Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了小天狼星布莱克！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:05.03,Title,0,0,0,0,,《哈利波特与混血王子》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.69,0:02:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方仍在进一步调查…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.56,0:03:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,千禧桥坍塌事件
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方搜寻幸存者期间，交通一度暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.65,0:03:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,事故现场周边区域仍处于戒备状态
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.49,0:03:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,市长呼吁伦敦市民保持冷静…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,“哈利·波特”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.58,0:03:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.88,0:03:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，谁也不是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.42,0:03:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是某个呆子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的报纸怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.13,0:03:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,前几天晚上，我敢发誓看到照片里的人动了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.93,0:03:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的？ - 我估计是干活累得看花眼了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿，我在想… - 11点，我那会下班
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.19,0:03:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候你可以跟我 慢慢讲讲这个呆瓜哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.87,0:04:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个夏天可是大胆得很啊，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.29,0:04:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢坐坐地铁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.58,0:04:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,免得胡思乱想
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着不怎么招人喜欢，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.34,0:04:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话，这倒是个挺惊险的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在不是说故事的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:04:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭着我的手臂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.31,0:05:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,照我说的做
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.15,0:05:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚是不是幻影移形了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.82,0:05:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，要我说，还很是成功
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.16,0:05:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝大多数人第一次都吐了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.95,0:05:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真让人想不通（反话）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.34,0:05:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到美丽的巴德莱·巴伯顿村
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.34,0:05:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，我猜，现在你正奇怪 我为什么要带你来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.80,0:05:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.68,0:05:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说，教授，经历这么多年 我差不多已经不想了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,拔出魔杖，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.87,0:06:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍拉斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍拉斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.94,0:07:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅林的胡子啊！ （意为我的老天爷！）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.61,0:07:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也没必要非得戳穿我啊，阿不思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.07,0:07:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不说，你这椅子变得很是成功，霍拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.78,0:07:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那都是表面功夫做的足，里子那是天然的（大肚子） 我哪儿露馅了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.12,0:07:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙血
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 哦，对了，我给你们介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.67,0:07:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，来来见见 我的这位老朋友，老同事…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍拉斯·斯拉格霍恩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.46,0:07:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍拉斯…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.13,0:07:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.47,0:07:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.64,0:07:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这房间布置得如此有舞台效果 怎么回事，霍拉斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.56,0:07:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会还在等别的客人吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.19,0:07:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,客人？我可不知道你什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.11,0:07:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，食死徒想招纳我，都一年多了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.73,0:07:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那是什么样的日子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:08:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能拒绝太多次 所以在任何一个地方我都呆不过一周
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家的麻瓜主人去加那利群岛度假了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.66,0:08:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想，我们最好还是把这里收拾一下 不介意吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.32,0:08:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.03,0:08:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 介意我用下洗手间吗？ - 当然不介意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.37,0:08:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别以为我不知道你为什么来，阿不思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.21,0:08:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案还是“不” 确定以及肯定的不
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.10,0:09:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长得很像你父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.31,0:09:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 除了这双眼睛，很像… - 我母亲的眼睛，我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.35,0:09:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉，伶俐的莉莉，你的母亲很聪慧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是再考虑到她还是个麻瓜出生 就更是了不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.74,0:09:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个最好的朋友也是麻瓜出生 是全年级最棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.49,0:09:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要以为我有偏见，没有，绝对没有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你母亲绝对是我最喜欢的学生之一 看，她就在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.08,0:09:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,前排
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是我的，所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.51,0:09:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是我以前的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.76,0:09:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认出巴拿巴斯·古费了吧 他是预言家日报的主编
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.10,0:09:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是对当天的新闻有什么看法 我就可以派猫头鹰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.77,0:09:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他捎个信
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.94,0:10:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,格韦诺格·琼斯 霍利黑德哈比队队长
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.07,0:10:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我想，随时都能拿到免费门票
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.78,0:10:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,自然了，我已经很久没有看比赛了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，对了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷古勒斯·布莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.45,0:10:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定认识他的哥哥 小天狼星，前几周刚刚过世
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.58,0:10:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱克全家都是我教的 除了小天狼星
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.29,0:10:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是可惜，他是个很有天赋的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.67,0:10:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷古勒斯一来，我就看好他了 当然，如果兄弟一起，就更完美了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.84,0:10:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍拉斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.76,0:10:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不介意我带走这个吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.85,0:10:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很喜欢这些针织的款式 - 当然，拿去吧，可你不会现在就走吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.69,0:10:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情已成定局时，我还是知道的 真是太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.98,0:10:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能劝你同我一起回霍格沃兹…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.45,0:10:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自然将不胜荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.57,0:10:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟波特一样，可都是可遇不可求啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.20,0:10:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，再会，霍拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.96,0:10:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.01,0:11:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我答应
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.93,0:11:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要原来梅乐思教授的办公室 我原来的那个像厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.68,0:11:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要加薪！这年头疯事不少！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.69,0:11:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实不少
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.74,0:11:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授，刚才到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有天赋，有名气，有力量 有霍拉斯重视的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.03,0:11:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯拉格霍恩教授 会想将你收入门下，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.62,0:11:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会是他所有门徒中最闪耀的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.17,0:11:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你，所以他才回霍格沃兹 对我们来说，他回来也很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.42,0:11:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我已经搅了 你这个原本美妙的夜晚，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那位姑娘，说真的，可真是漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.93,0:11:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事，教授，我明天回去 找点借口跟她解释就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.56,0:12:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚可回不了小惠金区，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.40,0:12:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是，海德薇怎么办？还有我的行李？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.57,0:12:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,都等着你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.73,0:12:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.86,0:12:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.48,0:12:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,金妮，什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利什么时候来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？哈利？哪个哈利？ - 当然是哈利·波特了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.12,0:12:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特要是在我家，我会不知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.45,0:13:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的行李就放在厨房呢，还有猫头鹰 - 不会吧，亲爱的，我可不信
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.58,0:13:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利？有谁说“哈利”了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.42,0:13:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的，多事鬼，他在楼上吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.55,0:13:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没，我死党要是在我屋，我会不知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.76,0:13:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是猫头鹰在叫吗？ - 你没见到他，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.43,0:13:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他貌似在这屋里游荡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.35,0:13:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的？ - 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.35,0:13:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.15,0:13:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.78,0:13:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不先跟我们说一声？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.66,0:13:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道要来，是邓不利多 - 哦，他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.66,0:13:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是爱乱来 可要是没了他，我们可怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.17,0:13:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你嘴角有点牙膏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.05,0:13:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没几天
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.26,0:14:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过在那之前，我犹豫了一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.39,0:14:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,老妈上星期有点神经过敏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.98,0:14:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我和金妮回霍格沃兹也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.98,0:14:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,说那里很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.52,0:14:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 - 不止她一个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.53,0:14:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连我爸妈，他们即使是麻瓜 也知道发生了不好的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.03,0:14:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样吧，老爸插话了 说老妈是一时糊涂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.20,0:14:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,劝了是有几天 不过最后她总算回心转意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.96,0:14:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说的可是霍格沃兹 是邓不利多，还有哪里更安全？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.54,0:14:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近有很多风言风语…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,说邓不利多老了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说，他才…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.34,0:14:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得多大了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.09,0:14:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百五十岁？差不离了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.37,0:15:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,西茜！你不能这么做！ 不能相信他！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.37,0:15:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑魔王信任他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑魔王被蒙蔽了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.87,0:15:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,退下吧，虫尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，我不该来这
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑魔王陛下禁止我谈论此事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.67,0:15:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果黑魔王不准你谈，你就不该谈
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下，贝拉，别人的东西，不要乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.89,0:16:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,巧的是，我知道你现在的处境，纳西莎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.02,0:16:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑魔王把这件事告诉了你？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.90,0:16:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妹妹质疑我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.48,0:16:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以理解，这么多年，我演的太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.49,0:16:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好得骗倒了有史以来最伟大的巫师之一
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.66,0:16:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓不利多是一名伟大的巫师 只有蠢材才会怀疑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.75,0:16:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怀疑你，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.83,0:16:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该感到荣耀，西茜，德拉科也是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.42,0:16:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还只是个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法动摇黑魔王的意志
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.80,0:16:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可以暗中帮助德拉科
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.23,0:16:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 西弗勒斯 - 发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.23,0:16:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,立一个牢不可破的誓言
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.53,0:17:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的都是空话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么“我会尽力”了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,可到了真正关键的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.29,0:17:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就只会滑回自己的蛇洞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,懦夫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.47,0:17:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出魔仗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.24,0:17:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.57,0:17:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,西弗勒斯·斯内普…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.78,0:17:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,能否看顾德拉科·马尔福…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.87,0:17:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,助他完成黑魔王的嘱托？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.83,0:17:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.13,0:18:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你，能否尽你所能…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.47,0:18:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护他，免受伤害？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.14,0:18:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.52,0:18:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果德拉科失败…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.14,0:18:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你，能否继续完成…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.94,0:18:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑魔王所托未竟之事？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.20,0:18:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.48,0:18:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧一瞧，看一看了，新到的昏迷花糖！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.65,0:18:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼻血牛扎糖！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.85,0:19:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 若想准时下课… - 就用呕吐片！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.28,0:19:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吐到坩埚里哦，小帅哥 - 吐到坩埚里哦，小帅哥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.92,0:19:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 隐身烟雾弹，秘鲁进口的 - 这可是我们的摇钱树
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.00,0:19:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱身必备哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.30,0:19:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了，女士们 - 好了，女士们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.22,0:19:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想试试迷魂药？ - 效果确实不错哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.68,0:19:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过话说回来，据我们掌握的情报 小妹，你自己就很玩得转嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.18,0:19:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.52,0:19:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是在和迪安·托马斯好着吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.10,0:19:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不关你们的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.61,0:19:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.82,0:19:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 五加隆 - 五加隆
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.36,0:19:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卖给我多少钱？ - 五加隆
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.66,0:19:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你们弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.24,0:19:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就十加隆 - 那就十加隆
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.20,0:19:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.33,0:20:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，罗恩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.02,0:20:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治和弗雷德怎么办到的？ 半条对角巷的店都关了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.23,0:20:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷德觉得，在这种时候 大家更需要点笑声
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.27,0:20:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.03,0:20:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.24,0:20:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家的魔杖都是从奥利凡德买的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.88,0:20:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.09,0:20:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是看花眼，还是那真是德拉科和他老妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.34,0:20:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼鬼祟祟不想被人看见？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.28,0:22:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,唱唱反调
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.41,0:22:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,唱唱反调
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.87,0:22:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个侏儒蒲真可爱，他们会在节礼日唱歌，你知道的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.71,0:22:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来份唱唱反调？ - 哦，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.30,0:22:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搔扰虻是什么？ - 那是一种隐形生物
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.01,0:22:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会钻进你耳朵，搞得你脑子一团糟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.72,0:22:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,唱唱反调
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.73,0:23:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说，德拉科要那个诡异的橱柜干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.65,0:23:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那群人，都谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.53,0:23:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看不出来吗？ 那是某种仪式，入会仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.82,0:23:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了，哈利，我知道你想说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.91,0:23:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实摆在眼前，他是他们的一份子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.58,0:23:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁们？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.83,0:23:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利觉得，德拉科·马尔福是食死徒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.46,0:23:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,少扯了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.59,0:23:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,神秘人要他能干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.88,0:23:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们说，他在博金-博克干嘛？挑家具？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.09,0:23:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪人逛怪店，见怪不怪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.14,0:23:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爸是食死徒，他也是，这才说得通
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.18,0:23:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏也亲眼看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.93,0:23:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过了，我不知道那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.98,0:23:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去透透气
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.25,0:24:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，等到了霍格沃兹，我们再收拾
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.44,0:24:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？布雷斯 - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.86,0:24:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张兮兮的 可能只是一些一年级小鬼在瞎闹
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.15,0:24:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了，德拉科，坐下 马上就到霍格沃兹了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.21,0:24:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃兹 找这么个借口去上学，真可悲
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.17,0:24:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我还得在那上两年学
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.34,0:25:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非得跳天文塔自杀不可
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.63,0:25:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这话什么意思啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.22,0:25:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说吧，明年 你就看不到我在魔咒课上浪费生命了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.85,0:25:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好笑吗，布雷斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.15,0:25:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就看是谁笑到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.71,0:25:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个先走 我还要检查下一点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.63,0:25:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.09,0:25:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能已经上站台了，走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.74,0:26:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你妈咪没告诉你 偷听很没礼貌吗，波特？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.41,0:26:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,统统石化！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.09,0:26:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没学会擦干口水，她就死了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.89,0:26:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一脚是替我父亲踢的 回伦敦旅行愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.90,0:27:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,咒立停
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.78,0:27:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好啊，哈利 - 卢娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.45,0:27:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道我在这？ - 骚扰虻，你满脑子都是
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.87,0:27:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不好意思，害你也错过马车，卢娜
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.71,0:27:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系，感觉像是跟朋友散步
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.05,0:27:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是你朋友，卢娜
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.51,0:27:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.47,0:27:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚好，我找你们两个半天了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.85,0:27:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，姓名？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.93,0:27:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗利维教授，你都认识我五年了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.48,0:27:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也不能例外，波特
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.15,0:28:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.07,0:28:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,傲罗，负责安全保卫的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.53,0:28:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根藤条是干什么的？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.28,0:28:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是藤条，你个蠢货，是手杖
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.70,0:28:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你准备拿这个干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.87,0:28:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可以拿来当武器使
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.12,0:28:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了，费尔奇，我能替马尔福担保
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.76,0:28:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一脸够帅啊，波特
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.27,0:28:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望我帮你治好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.77,0:28:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我个人觉得，你这样看着更不修边幅…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.73,0:28:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过治不治由你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.69,0:28:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个，你以前治过鼻子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.15,0:28:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没，脚趾头倒是治过一些 能差得到哪里去呢，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.91,0:28:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，好吧，那就试试
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.25,0:29:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 愈合如初 - 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.42,0:29:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看起来怎么样？ - 异常得正常
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.72,0:29:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.48,0:29:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，他一会就到了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.40,0:29:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能别吃了？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.28,0:29:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好的朋友不见了！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.70,0:29:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶，回头看，小疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.75,0:29:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又满身是血
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.87,0:29:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他怎么老是浑身是血？ - 好像这回是他自己的血
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.13,0:29:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿了？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.17,0:29:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的脸怎么了？ - 呆会再说
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.80,0:29:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错过什么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.97,0:29:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,分院帽鼓励大伙，在这种乱世 要变得更勇敢坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.93,0:29:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,它说得倒轻巧，是不？它不过是顶帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.32,0:30:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.19,0:30:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.45,0:30:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先，我给大家介绍一下新教员
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.28,0:30:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍拉斯·斯拉格霍恩
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.42,0:30:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯拉格霍恩教授，我在此荣幸地宣布…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.46,0:30:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经同意回来继任魔药课教授
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.92,0:30:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,与此同时，黑魔法防御课教授
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.01,0:30:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,将由斯内普教授担任
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.22,0:30:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯内普？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.73,0:30:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如各位所知
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.52,0:30:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,每人在今晚入校前都被搜查
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.36,0:30:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有权知道原因
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.15,0:30:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,从前，有个年轻人，他和你们一样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.91,0:30:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐过这个大厅
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.74,0:31:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,走过这里的走廊，睡过这里的床铺
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.95,0:31:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来和其他人没什么两样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.50,0:31:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.50,0:31:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫汤姆·里德尔
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.01,0:31:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今，当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.22,0:31:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,世人只知道他的另一个名字
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.73,0:31:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因此，此时此刻，我看着诸位
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.11,0:31:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,想起来一个不争的事实
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.65,0:31:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天，每时
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.95,0:31:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至于就在这一刻，或许
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.07,0:31:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗势力就在试图侵入这城堡的高墙
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.04,0:31:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最终，他们最致命的武器，还是你们
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.63,0:31:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你们能好好想想
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.01,0:31:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，上床去吧，晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.26,0:32:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可真叫鼓舞人心
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.35,0:32:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们，魔法史在楼上上课，不是楼下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.90,0:32:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴维斯！戴维斯（先生）！那里是女厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.70,0:32:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.45,0:32:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.71,0:32:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近过的不错，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.00,0:32:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我早上没课 - 我发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.71,0:32:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你大概会考虑去上魔药课
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.30,0:32:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,又或者你已经不再想当傲罗了？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.76,0:32:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想，可我得先在O.W.L考试里拿“优秀”
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.56,0:32:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实，斯内普教授教魔药的时候是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.60,0:32:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，斯拉格霍恩教授会很乐意收
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.35,0:32:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,得“良好”的N.W.E.T.s学生
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.65,0:32:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了，嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.48,0:32:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那，我这就过去 - 很好，很好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.11,0:33:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特，把韦斯莱也带上 他看起来太快活了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.83,0:33:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想上魔药课
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.29,0:33:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,魁地奇球员选拔就要开始了 我还得多练练呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.25,0:33:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在准备阶段关注细节…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.38,0:33:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是所有计划成功的先觉条件
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.71,0:33:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，孩子，我都开始担心了 我看你还带了朋友过来嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.26,0:33:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫罗恩·韦斯莱，教授
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.01,0:33:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我魔药学得糟透了 说实话，要我煎药对别人也是威胁
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.64,0:33:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以我… - 胡说，我们上完课才知道
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.89,0:33:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利的朋友就是我的朋友 把书都拿出来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.15,0:33:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的书还没到，罗恩也没书
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.86,0:33:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去壁橱里找找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.73,0:33:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才我们说到，今早 我准备了一些汤剂
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.24,0:33:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有谁知道这些都是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.70,0:33:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好，这位…？ - 格兰杰，教授
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.54,0:33:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那锅是吐真剂，可以令人吐露真相
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.17,0:33:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那锅是复方汤剂
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.51,0:34:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,熬制起来相当复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.34,0:34:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这锅，是迷情剂
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.56,0:34:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上最强效的迷魂药
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.89,0:34:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说，它因人而异，会散发出 最吸引当事人的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.02,0:34:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如，我闻到的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.77,0:34:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚割过的草坪 崭新的羊皮纸，和…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.99,0:34:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,留兰香味牙膏
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.74,0:34:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷情剂不能产生真正的爱情 因为爱情不可能仿造
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.37,0:34:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它确实可以令人产生迷恋
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.54,0:34:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此，这可能是这个房间里最危险的魔药
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.76,0:34:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授，你还没说，那个锅里的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.93,0:34:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，对了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.81,0:34:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们，你们所看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.56,0:35:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一种神奇的药水，叫福灵剂
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.40,0:35:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过，人们通常都称之为…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.82,0:35:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 幸运水 - 正是，格兰杰小姐，幸运水
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.62,0:35:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,制作过程极度繁复 稍有差错，后果便不堪设想
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.41,0:35:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需一小口，你的所有努力 便能轻而易举地成功
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.46,0:35:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少，在药效过去之前是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.80,0:35:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢，今天我就拿它做奖品
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.80,0:35:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一小瓶的幸运水，将奖励给…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.81,0:35:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,能在一个小时内，熬制出生死水（强效安眠药）的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.56,0:35:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所需的材料都罗列在书本的第十页
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.98,0:35:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我要提醒大家，在此之前 只有一名学生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.82,0:35:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,熬出了合格的生死水，赢得这个奖励
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.82,0:35:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,话虽如此，还是祝各位好运！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.87,0:35:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就正式开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.38,0:36:00.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（此书乃混血王子之财产）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.36,0:36:24.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（切碎跳跳豆 用刀侧碾碎 更易出汁）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.49,0:36:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么办到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.87,0:36:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用碾的，别切
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.20,0:36:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对，书上写的明明白白，要切
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.87,0:36:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用，真的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.20,0:37:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅林的胡子啊！真是完美
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.87,0:37:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,太完美了，我敢说只要一滴 就能让全班的人都睡死过去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.38,0:37:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，如我所承诺的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.51,0:37:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,奖励福灵剂一瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.89,0:37:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.43,0:37:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好使用
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.79,0:38:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，你收到信了，进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.13,0:38:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.68,0:38:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，教授
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.39,0:38:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,课还喜欢吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.89,0:38:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道斯拉格霍恩教授尤为喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.64,0:38:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他是高估我的水平了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.64,0:38:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真这么想？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.31,0:38:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,千真万确
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.57,0:38:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的课外活动如何啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.61,0:38:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 您什么意思？ - 我注意到…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.78,0:38:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经常和格兰杰小姐一起出入
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.58,0:38:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以忍不住猜测…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.99,0:38:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，没，没有，她是很棒 我们也是朋友，但不是您猜的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.16,0:38:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬请原谅，我这纯属好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.25,0:38:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,闲聊得够多的了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.34,0:38:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定在奇怪，我今晚为什么要请你过来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.51,0:38:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.35,0:38:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所看到的这些都是记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.68,0:39:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个小瓶里装的，就是关于伏地魔的…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.69,0:39:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我们可以称之为，汤姆·里德尔
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.19,0:39:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个小瓶里装的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.20,0:39:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我第一次见到他时候的情景
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.74,0:39:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是愿意，我很希望你能看看
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.16,0:40:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得承认，接到你的来信我有些困惑 邓不利多先生
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.74,0:40:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年了，从来没有什么亲戚来看过汤姆
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.37,0:40:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他孩子身上发生过一些事故，可怕的事故
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.55,0:40:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆，有人来看望你了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.26,0:40:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你过得怎么样，汤姆？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.43,0:40:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.48,0:40:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是医生，是不是？ - 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.78,0:40:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是教授
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.53,0:40:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.53,0:40:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想让我去看病
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.12,0:40:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们觉得我跟别人不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.50,0:40:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，他们可能还真说对了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.16,0:40:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没疯
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.79,0:40:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃兹不是疯人院
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.29,0:40:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃兹是所学校
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.05,0:40:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,传授魔法的学校
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.72,0:41:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做一些事，对不对，汤姆？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.60,0:41:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些别的孩子做不到的事
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.64,0:41:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用碰，就能让东西动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.52,0:41:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用教，就能让动物听我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.90,0:41:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有谁对我不好，我就能让他遭殃
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.07,0:41:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能伤害他们…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.66,0:41:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我想
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.74,0:41:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.79,0:41:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你一样，汤姆
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.17,0:41:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,与众不同
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.67,0:41:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明给我看
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.68,0:41:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的衣柜里好像有些什么东西 想钻出来啊，汤姆
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.23,0:42:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃兹不容许偷窃
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.20,0:42:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在霍格沃兹，你不仅要学习如何使用魔法 还要学习如何控制魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.03,0:42:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白我的意思吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.16,0:42:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能和蛇说话
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.96,0:42:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是它们找到我的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.75,0:42:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说悄悄话
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.92,0:42:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对像我这样的人来说，正常吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.11,0:42:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时知道吗，教授？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.58,0:42:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我刚见到了有史以来最邪恶的黑巫师？ 当然不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.79,0:42:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我知道，我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.54,0:43:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在霍格沃兹的这些年里…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.17,0:43:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆·里德尔和一个老师走得特别近
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.68,0:43:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜看那个老师是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.43,0:43:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你劝斯拉格霍恩教授回来 不止是教魔药课，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.06,0:43:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不止
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.27,0:43:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯拉格霍恩教授有一样东西 是我迫切需要的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.11,0:43:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自然也不会轻易地交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.15,0:43:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说他会想招我入门
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.53,0:43:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.49,0:43:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我答应吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.87,0:43:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.41,0:44:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.29,0:45:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早，我们会进行几轮选拔
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.54,0:45:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,考核你们的实力
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.38,0:45:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请安静下！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.55,0:45:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,都闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.55,0:45:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢，那个，然后…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.47,0:45:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你们去年是正式队员
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.77,0:45:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不保证你们今年也是 这么说，明白了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.23,0:45:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.24,0:45:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯莱，别介意，好嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.99,0:45:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,介意？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.37,0:45:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要打守球手这个位置 真不是针对你
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.08,0:45:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？以你这个头？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.92,0:45:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得你更适合当击球手吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.67,0:45:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,守球手要眼疾手快
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.47,0:45:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我还是想先试试运气
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.43,0:45:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说，你能给我介绍介绍 你那朋友格兰杰吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.39,0:45:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,要能知名知姓就最好了 懂我的意思吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.86,0:46:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，韦斯莱！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.74,0:46:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加油，罗恩！ - 上啊，韦斯莱！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.99,0:46:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上！韦斯莱！- 好 罗恩
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.04,0:46:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，考迈克！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.81,0:46:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，罗恩！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.57,0:46:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油啊，罗恩
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.34,0:47:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,速速混淆
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.61,0:47:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真是太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.69,0:47:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说，最后一个我真没想到能接住
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.53,0:47:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿考迈克别太难受
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.74,0:47:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对你有点意思，赫敏，就那个考迈克
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.87,0:47:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可不讨人喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.84,0:47:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听说过这个咒语吗？ 神锋无影？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.26,0:47:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听过
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.51,0:47:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是还尊敬自己那么一点点 你就该把书上交
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.80,0:48:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都别想，他现在可是尖子生
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.43,0:48:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你都强呢，赫敏 斯拉格霍恩都把他当天才了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.73,0:48:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,咋了？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.85,0:48:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道这书到底是谁的 给我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.73,0:48:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不给
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.74,0:48:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.57,0:48:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这书的装订线都松了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.36,0:48:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 装订松了？ - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.25,0:48:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 混血王子是谁？ - 谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.00,0:48:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是这么写的：“此书乃混血王子之财产”
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.10,0:48:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么久了，你到哪都带着这本书 就差抱着它睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.61,0:48:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你却一点都不想知道这人是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.07,0:48:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说我不好奇 再说我还没到抱着它睡觉的地步
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.65,0:48:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,也也差不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.86,0:49:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想睡前夜谈，你就只知道捧着本书看
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.78,0:49:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直跟赫敏第二过日子一样
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.08,0:49:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些好奇，所以就去…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.75,0:49:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 图书馆 - 然后呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.21,0:49:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没找到
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.00,0:49:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论什么地方 都没有提到过混血王子半句
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.21,0:49:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就是了，这事就算完了 - 费力斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.47,0:49:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想能在三把扫帚里找见你呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.97,0:49:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕不行了，合唱团急训，霍拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.14,0:49:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想喝黄油啤酒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.90,0:49:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个老伙计，在克拉克比山上滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.32,0:49:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有辆自己造的，挪威风格的长雪橇
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.11,0:49:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别，别去那边，到这边来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.20,0:49:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,别坐对面，坐我旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.49,0:49:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.25,0:49:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝点什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.79,0:49:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,三杯黄油啤酒 我的那份放点姜汁，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.09,0:50:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.02,0:50:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个小白脸
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.19,0:50:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩，他们只是在牵牵小手
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.69,0:50:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,又亲亲小嘴了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.61,0:50:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得走了 - 怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.74,0:50:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会是认真的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.49,0:50:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那可是我妹妹 - 那又怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.03,0:50:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是她转头看到你亲我怎么办？ 你想她会走开吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.25,0:50:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿！ - 您好，教授，真高兴见到您
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.87,0:50:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是，我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.04,0:50:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,您来这做什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.00,0:50:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,三把扫帚和我的渊源说起来可就深了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.88,0:50:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得当初 它叫一把扫帚时候的样子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.51,0:50:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意喽，格兰杰 这样，孩子，过去呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.02,0:50:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会偶尔举办几场晚宴
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.60,0:50:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,只邀请那么一两个学生
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.98,0:50:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你愿意来吗？ - 荣幸之至，教授
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.28,0:51:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也欢迎你来，格兰杰
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.28,0:51:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太谢谢了，教授 - 好极了，等我的猫头鹰送信哦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.91,0:51:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴见到你，华伦比 （彻底记错罗恩名字了）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.79,0:51:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是玩的哪一手？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.30,0:51:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓不利多让我多了解他
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.80,0:51:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 了解他？ - 不晓得
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.93,0:51:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事一定很重要 要不然，邓不利多也不会让我去
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.27,0:51:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你嘴角有一点…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.28,0:51:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂，你都不知道这里装的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.33,0:51:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利 - 什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.95,0:51:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在酒吧里说的那段话，关于我俩亲亲的 你也听到了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.25,0:51:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.42,0:52:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告过她的，让她别碰
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.24,0:52:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别靠近，所有人，都退后
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.50,0:52:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非包着，否则别碰，记住了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.81,0:53:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定凯蒂进三把扫帚的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.57,0:53:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没带着这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.70,0:53:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.45,0:53:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去上厕所，回来之后就拿着那个包裹
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.62,0:53:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说，她要把包送到，事关重大
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.16,0:53:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她有没有说，要送到谁那儿？ - 邓不利多教授
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.00,0:53:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，谢谢你，黎安，你先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.38,0:53:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么每次有什么事发生 总是你们在场？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.97,0:53:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我，教授 我问自己这个问题问了都六年了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.94,0:53:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.24,0:53:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.03,0:53:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看，贝尔小姐还能活着，真是幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.00,0:53:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被下了恶咒，是不是？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.41,0:54:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道凯蒂，在魁地奇球场之外的地方 她连只苍蝇都舍不得伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.58,0:54:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算她要把包裹交给邓不利多 也肯定不是有意识的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.34,0:54:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定是被下了恶咒
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.05,0:54:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是马尔福干的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.64,0:54:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特，这个指控非常严重
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.60,0:54:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.93,0:54:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有什么证据？ - 我就是知道
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.10,0:54:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.32,0:54:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.78,0:54:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的天赋可真是了不得，波特
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.86,0:54:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的天赋，凡人做梦也别想有
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.99,0:54:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么伟大，你这救世主
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.80,0:54:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议，你们都回宿舍去，所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.81,0:55:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得迪安看上金妮哪点了？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.44,0:55:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那金妮又看上他什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.61,0:55:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪安？他很聪明啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.99,0:55:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不到五个小时之前，你还叫他小白脸
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.99,0:55:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个，他那会不是对我妹妹动手动脚嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.95,0:55:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经一绷，你就非恨他不可，懂不？ 那是原则问题
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.16,0:55:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.92,0:55:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你说，他看上她什么了？ - 不晓得
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.84,0:55:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她聪明，有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.01,0:55:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很迷人 - 迷人？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.85,0:55:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是，她皮肤很好啊 - 皮肤？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.18,0:55:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪安跟我妹妹好，就因为她皮肤好？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.19,0:55:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是啦，我只是说 这可能是原因之一
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.07,0:55:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏的皮肤也很好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.53,0:55:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得吗？就事论事来说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.24,0:55:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真没想过这个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.87,0:56:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过，我估计，是的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.33,0:56:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是很好
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.21,0:56:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我该睡觉了 - 哦，对
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.43,0:56:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说吧，考迈克，最近 有没有见你叔叔贝卢斯啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.56,0:56:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的，教授，实际上 这个假期，我该去和他…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.23,0:56:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有魔法部部长一起去打猎
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.61,0:56:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了代我向他们二位问好
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.74,0:56:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叔叔呢，巴尔比？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.91,0:56:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防有人没听说过，我介绍一下 马科斯的叔叔发明了狼毒药剂（防止狼人变身的药）
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.53,0:56:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他最近有在搞什么新发明啊？ - 不晓得
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.50,0:56:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和我爸关系不好，可能是因为 我爸说魔药都是垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.75,0:56:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说唯一有用的魔药 就是回家喝的几口烈酒
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.21,0:56:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢，格兰杰小姐？ 你父母在麻瓜的世界里哪里高就啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.09,0:56:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母都是牙医
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.47,0:57:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,给别人治牙齿
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.93,0:57:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,太有趣了，这个职业危险吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.86,0:57:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不算是
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.11,0:57:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过，是有个男孩，叫罗宾·芬克 咬了我爸爸一口
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.78,0:57:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,害得他缝了十针
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.29,0:57:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，韦斯莱小姐，快请进
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.63,0:57:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看她眼色，她跟迪安又吵架了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.21,0:57:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，我一般不会迟到
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.72,0:57:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系，来得正好，还能来点甜点 当然了，要是还没被巴尔比吃精光
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.07,0:57:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.32,0:57:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.28,0:58:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了，再见
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.79,0:58:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 波特 - 抱歉，教授
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.71,0:58:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚在欣赏您的沙漏
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.67,0:58:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.68,0:58:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣的小玩意儿
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.39,0:58:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙粒掉落的速度和谈话的质量相关
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.93,0:58:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果谈话有趣，沙粒就落得慢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.69,0:58:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果无聊… - 我想我该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.77,0:58:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说，你有什么好怕的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.28,0:58:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于你的一些同学…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.69,0:58:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说吧，他们可上不了我的架子
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.28,0:58:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么架子，教授？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.37,0:58:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些有抱负的学生，都希望想上那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.16,0:58:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过话说回来，你已经是个人物了 不是吗，哈利？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.58,0:58:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔上过这个架子吗，教授？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.71,0:59:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,您认识他，对吧？ 汤姆·里德尔，您教过他
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.72,0:59:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,里德尔在霍格沃兹的时候 有过很多老师
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.39,0:59:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他那时候什么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.69,0:59:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，教授，恕我多问
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.73,0:59:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀死了我父母
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.32,0:59:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.99,0:59:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想多知道一些，可以理解
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.08,0:59:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过恐怕我要让你失望了，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.83,0:59:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次见到里德尔，他虽然聪明…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.25,0:59:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,却很安静，一心想成为一流的巫师
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.67,0:59:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我认识的其他学生并没有太大区别
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.01,0:59:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上，和你也没有多大区别
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.43,0:59:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要说真有魔鬼…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.05,0:59:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也藏得很深
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.61,1:00:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好运，罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.53,1:00:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这帽子可真帅！ - 罗恩，衰人！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.16,1:00:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可指望你了，罗恩 我压了两加隆赌霍格沃兹赢呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.41,1:00:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看起来不错啊，罗恩 - 衰人！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.96,1:00:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他戴的是什么玩意？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.10,1:00:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.14,1:00:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪个怎么样？ - 你的聚会啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.64,1:00:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的，挺无聊的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.06,1:00:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过哈利应该挺喜欢那些点心
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.82,1:00:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯拉格霍恩还要开圣诞舞会
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.74,1:00:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以带别人
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.45,1:00:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你会带麦克拉根去吧 他也是鼻涕虫俱乐部的，对不？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.33,1:00:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其实，本来我是想请你的 - 真的？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.00,1:00:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天好运了，罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.83,1:01:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是最棒的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.22,1:01:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要退队，今天比完就退 让麦克拉根接替吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.14,1:01:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后的事由你
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.80,1:01:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来点南瓜汁先？ - 好
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.47,1:01:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.43,1:01:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去糟透了，罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.69,1:01:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为这个 你才往他杯子里放东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.28,1:01:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是补药吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.36,1:01:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运水
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.37,1:01:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别喝，罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.63,1:01:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这么干会被开除的 - 我可不知道你什么意思
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.21,1:01:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，哈利，咱们还有比赛要赢呢！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.99,1:02:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，罗恩！搞掂它！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.78,1:02:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯莱！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.08,1:02:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯莱！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.84,1:03:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯莱！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.14,1:03:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真不该那么做
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.02,1:03:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，也许我该用混淆咒
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.02,1:03:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不一样，那是选拔，这是真正的比赛
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.45,1:03:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没放
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.87,1:03:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩只是以为我放了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.50,1:04:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,咒语，我只是练练
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.72,1:04:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.06,1:04:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么感觉，哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.90,1:04:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见迪安和金妮一起的时候？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.20,1:04:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都知道
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.74,1:04:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你看她的眼神
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.62,1:05:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.34,1:05:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哦
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.59,1:05:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方被人占了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.59,1:05:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些鸟是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.39,1:05:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,万弹齐发
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.13,1:05:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种感觉就是这样的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.54,1:06:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要是这么爱发神经，我也没办法
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.76,1:06:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉弗和我，我这么说吧 简直是停不下啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.01,1:06:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说中爱的化学反应
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.60,1:06:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会不会长久？谁知道呢？ 关键是，我可是自由身
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.10,1:06:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想亲谁就亲谁
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.10,1:06:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我压根就不想管
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.69,1:06:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前我是不是误以为我和他 会一起出席斯拉格霍恩的圣诞晚会？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.69,1:07:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.36,1:07:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今，以眼下的情况看 我得另作一些安排了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.95,1:07:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你安排好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.33,1:07:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.50,1:07:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为，既然我们两个 都没有理想的男女伴
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.29,1:07:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,干脆就我们一起，以朋友的身份
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.71,1:07:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前怎么没想到？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.50,1:07:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟谁一起去？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.21,1:07:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃，惊喜
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.17,1:07:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之，我们要担心的人是你 你不能随便带个人就去
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.01,1:07:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那边的女孩子了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.52,1:07:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗米达·万尼，很显然 她想偷带迷魂药进学校
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.40,1:07:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.86,1:07:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！她对你感兴趣无非是因为 她以为你是所谓的救世主
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.48,1:07:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我确实是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.36,1:07:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，抱歉，呃，开开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.24,1:07:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会请我喜欢的人一起
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.49,1:07:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷一些的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.80,1:08:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没来过城堡的这个地方
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.01,1:08:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少醒着的时候没有，我会梦游
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.43,1:08:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才穿鞋子上床
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.13,1:08:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语] 门户开启
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.64,1:08:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语] 门户开启
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.94,1:09:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语] 门户开启
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.25,1:09:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,来一杯？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.58,1:09:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.09,1:09:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没能进鼻涕虫俱乐部
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.71,1:09:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过没关系 他还让巴尔比在厕所递毛巾呢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.01,1:09:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦，不用了，谢谢 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.23,1:09:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏，你在这干嘛？发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.36,1:09:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚跑掉了 把考迈克丢在槲寄生下头
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.82,1:09:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,考迈克？你请了他？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.03,1:09:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为，这样最能惹罗恩不高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.37,1:09:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，呆会再聊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.54,1:09:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他简直比贪吃根还多长了几根触角
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.71,1:10:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来点龙肉干？ - 不用了，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.04,1:10:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是，吃了这玩意口气重得不行
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.88,1:10:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我改主意了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.88,1:10:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样或许能让考迈克保持距离
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.22,1:10:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天，他过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.68,1:10:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她是去洗手间了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.73,1:10:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这朋友可真是个小泥鳅
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.98,1:10:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘴巴也是一刻闲不下来，对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.73,1:10:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吃的这什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.90,1:10:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙蛋蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.75,1:10:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚给你自己 争取到了一个月的禁闭，麦克拉根
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.05,1:10:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别溜这么快，波特
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.47,1:10:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授，我想我该回去找我的女伴了…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.76,1:10:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你少陪一两分钟，她也死不了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.85,1:11:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,再者，我只是来传个口信
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.73,1:11:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 口信？ - 邓不利多教授
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.15,1:11:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我代他问好，祝你聚会愉快
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.98,1:11:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.69,1:11:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他出校了，得到新学期才回来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.41,1:11:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,出校，去哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.08,1:11:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手拿开，你个肮脏的哑炮！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.09,1:11:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯拉格霍恩教授
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.96,1:11:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚发现了这男孩 在楼上的走廊里游荡
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.47,1:11:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说，你邀请了他参加聚会
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.68,1:11:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了好了，我不请自来，行了吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.20,1:11:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我领他出去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.83,1:11:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.13,1:11:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，各位，继续
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.46,1:12:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我是给那个叫贝尔的下了咒 也许我没有，关你什么事？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.55,1:12:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发过誓要保护你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.80,1:12:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我立下了牢不可破的誓言
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.31,1:12:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要人保护
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.64,1:12:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这么多人当中，他只选了我，我！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.73,1:12:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会让他失望 - 你很害怕，德拉科
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.86,1:12:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试图掩饰，但太明显了，让我帮你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.95,1:12:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.74,1:12:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,被他选中，这次的荣耀是我的！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.59,1:12:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,“牢不可破的誓言”
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.34,1:12:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定斯内普这么说的？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.14,1:12:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.60,1:12:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不能违背牢不可破的誓言
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.27,1:12:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一层我自己就差不多想到了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.11,1:12:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道有多严重
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.48,1:12:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.34,1:13:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.02,1:13:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可爱
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.73,1:13:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她成天就想亲我 我嘴唇都被亲干了，瞧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.19,1:13:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说就是了，我信
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.49,1:13:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那后果会多严重？ 如果你违背了牢不可破的誓言？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.00,1:13:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会死
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.29,1:14:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,布丁还在哦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.42,1:14:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔给德拉科·马尔福 指派了一个任务？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.93,1:14:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道听起来很疯狂
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.18,1:14:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有想过 斯内普只是假装要帮德拉科
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.85,1:14:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,从而套取情报？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.52,1:14:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听起来不像 - 也许哈利没错
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.06,1:14:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,立牢不可破的誓言，是…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.86,1:14:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,归根结底，还是看你相不相信 邓不利多的判断
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.53,1:14:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邓不利多信任斯内普，所以我也信 - 邓不利多也会犯错
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.78,1:14:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是被仇恨蒙蔽了双眼
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.11,1:14:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有 - 你就是
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.91,1:14:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,天天都有人失踪，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.08,1:14:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能信任的人也只剩寥寥几个
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.21,1:14:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果现在内讧，我们就输定了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.65,1:15:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,张嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.86,1:15:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不信任我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.75,1:15:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.75,1:15:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…那个…啥
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.34,1:15:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来个派？ - 不用了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.06,1:15:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你一定体谅莱姆斯
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.86,1:15:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这种状况是有一些代价
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.61,1:15:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧，韦斯莱先生？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.82,1:15:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被人跟踪
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.53,1:15:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数时候，莫利都不出门
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.87,1:15:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,日子是不好过
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.96,1:16:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你收到我的猫头鹰了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.54,1:16:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，收到了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.13,1:16:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果邓不利多出校了 那对魔法部来说肯定是新闻
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.34,1:16:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过，或许他就是想这样
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.51,1:16:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于德拉科·马尔福
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.64,1:16:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是知道得多一点
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.43,1:16:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 继续说 - 我派人去博金-博克
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.64,1:16:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你的描述来看，我想…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.15,1:16:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏天你和罗恩看到的…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.98,1:16:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个让马尔福那么感兴趣的东西…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.65,1:16:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个消失柜
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.03,1:16:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,消失柜？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.49,1:16:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是伏地魔刚得势时候流行的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.66,1:16:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以想象它的吸引力 要是有食死徒找上门来
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.79,1:16:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要躲进柜子里，消失上一两个小时
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.17,1:16:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些柜子能把你送到几乎任何一个角落
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.09,1:16:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这玩意可靠不大住，效果时有时无
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.63,1:16:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,博金-博克那个怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.72,1:16:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.68,1:16:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在那
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.48,1:17:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚饭真美味，莫利
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.36,1:17:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真不留下吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.86,1:17:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了，该走了，月初第一天总是最难熬的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.41,1:17:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱姆斯？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.38,1:17:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.22,1:17:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩上床去了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.14,1:17:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃，还没吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.77,1:17:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,鞋带松了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.70,1:17:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.99,1:18:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.80,1:18:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利，别去！ - 莱姆斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.94,1:18:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,金妮！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.53,1:18:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了小天狼星布莱克！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.37,1:18:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来抓我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.70,1:18:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，你抓得到我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.78,1:19:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.67,1:19:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,昏昏倒地！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.20,1:20:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.46,1:20:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,金妮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.24,1:20:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫利
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.72,1:21:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要害你太容易了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.60,1:21:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没死都是运气好 哈利，你该明白，你有多重要
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.90,1:21:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，赫敏，好了吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.40,1:21:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.28,1:21:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉弗，我当然会戴了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.78,1:21:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我的好恩恩
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.95,1:21:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，我得去吐会
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.02,1:21:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想知道，你是哪儿得到的消息
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.48,1:21:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比多半的教工还消息灵通
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.15,1:22:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.15,1:22:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅乐思教授要退休了，是真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.16,1:22:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呀，汤姆，我肯定不能 直接告诉你我知道，对不对？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.20,1:22:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有，多谢你带来的菠萝 这确实是我的最爱
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.96,1:22:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你是怎么知道的？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.08,1:22:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,直觉
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.79,1:22:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呀，都到点了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.67,1:22:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,都回去吧，孩子们，要不然 迪佩特校长可要罚你们全关禁闭了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.47,1:22:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快啊，汤姆，你可不想 在熄灯之后被人抓个正着吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.22,1:22:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么事吗，汤姆？ - 有，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.64,1:22:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样，我想不出还能找谁
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.40,1:22:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别的教授，他们不像你
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.78,1:22:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们或许会误解我
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.99,1:22:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续说
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.37,1:23:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,某天晚上我在图书馆
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.20,1:23:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,禁书区
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.16,1:23:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,读到一些关于某种罕见魔法的材料
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.63,1:23:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想，您或许可以指点我
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.30,1:23:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我没记错，那个东西叫…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.01,1:23:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.35,1:23:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种东西，我听都没听过 就算知道，也不会告诉你！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.10,1:23:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上给我离开这里 以后也别再跟我提起这件事！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.86,1:23:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,很困惑吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.69,1:23:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是不觉得，我倒会很吃惊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.11,1:23:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白，刚才那是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.03,1:23:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这或许是我所搜集的记忆中最重要的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.03,1:23:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这同时也是个谎言
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.70,1:23:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个记忆被篡改过
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.66,1:23:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是被它的主人，我们的老朋友 斯拉格霍恩教授
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.67,1:23:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么要改自己的记忆？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.84,1:23:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我猜，他是以此为耻 - 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.88,1:23:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.18,1:24:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你去接近斯拉格霍恩教授 你也办到了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.72,1:24:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着，我想请你，劝他交出真实的记忆
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.52,1:24:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你用什么办法都行
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.23,1:24:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那么了解他，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.65,1:24:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这段记忆就是一切
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.07,1:24:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有它，我们无异于瞎子
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.57,1:24:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有它，我们只能 将这世界的命运拱手相让
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.25,1:24:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别无选择
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.29,1:24:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能失败
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.38,1:24:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我强烈建议各位重新温习
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.89,1:24:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,解药这一章
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.51,1:24:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,下节课我们继续讲解牛粪石的神奇功效 现在下课
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.43,1:24:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈，这不是我的小尾巴嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.40,1:24:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈，这不是我的魔药王子嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.36,1:25:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么是我可以效劳的啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.45,1:25:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授，我能不能向您请教点事情
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.70,1:25:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管问吧，孩子，尽管问
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.12,1:25:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,前几天晚上，我在图书馆的禁书区
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.29,1:25:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,读到了一些关于某种罕见魔法的材料
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.29,1:25:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，那个东西叫什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.13,1:25:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记不大清楚了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.63,1:25:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我在想，是不是有些魔法 教授们是不能教学生的？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.97,1:25:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是魔药课老师，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.48,1:25:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这个问题你最好还是问斯内普教授
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.48,1:25:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，呃
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.56,1:25:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他跟我，看对方都不是很顺眼
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.23,1:25:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.86,1:25:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不像您
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.32,1:25:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会误解我
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.45,1:25:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，没有黑暗哪里有光明
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.45,1:25:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法也是如此，而我 总是努力活在光明的一面
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.12,1:25:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议，你也这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.17,1:25:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆·里德尔问您这个问题的时候 您也是这么回答他说的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.14,1:26:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓不利多安排你来的，是不是？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.18,1:26:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是！？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.19,1:26:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.86,1:26:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，是你啊，波特
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.16,1:26:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，我现在很忙
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.34,1:26:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真美，是不？这个月亮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.13,1:26:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,美极了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.22,1:26:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好享用了点睡前甜点，对不？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.64,1:26:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,盒子就放在你床上 我想吃一颗也没大碍
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.39,1:26:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或者是吃20颗 - 我没有一刻不想她，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.06,1:26:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话，我还以为你觉得她烦了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.23,1:27:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么可能会烦到我
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.36,1:27:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想，我是爱上她了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.49,1:27:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.62,1:27:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得她知道我的存在吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.42,1:27:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿吧，她和你都亲了三个多月嘴了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.08,1:27:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲嘴？你说谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.96,1:27:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的又是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.97,1:27:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是罗米达，罗米达·万尼
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.76,1:27:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，真好笑
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.39,1:27:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你干嘛？ - 这不是玩笑！我爱上她了！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.23,1:27:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，你爱上她了，可你见过她吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.07,1:27:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没，你能给我介绍吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.71,1:28:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,来，罗恩，我介绍 罗米达·万尼给你认识
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.23,1:28:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，教授，如果不是绝对必要 我不会打搅您的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.78,1:28:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗米达在哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.36,1:28:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,温比这是怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.82,1:28:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,强效迷魂药
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.82,1:28:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样，扶他进来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.37,1:28:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为调配解药对你来说 是小菜一碟，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.83,1:28:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这个还得经验丰富的高手来，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.92,1:28:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的，想喝一杯吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.17,1:28:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你说得没错
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.34,1:28:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有，对不起，教授 关于之前的，那些误会
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.93,1:29:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，哪里哪里 过去的就让它过去吧，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.48,1:29:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这么多年，您都被问的厌烦了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.56,1:29:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些有关伏地魔的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.32,1:29:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说那个名字
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.87,1:29:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，大男孩，干光这杯
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.12,1:29:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？ - 给你壮壮胆
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.76,1:29:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我怎么了？ - 迷魂药
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.22,1:29:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是强效的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.94,1:29:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感觉糟透了 - 你得喝点提神的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.73,1:29:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这里有黄油啤酒，葡萄酒 还有陈年的橡树蜜酒
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.57,1:29:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来是另有他用的 不过，现在这个情况特殊…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.20,1:29:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿好了，波特
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.08,1:29:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬人生！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.37,1:30:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.88,1:30:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩，教授，快想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.42,1:30:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.44,1:30:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油啊，罗恩，呼吸
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.47,1:30:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那群女孩，要我命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.31,1:31:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑子转得很快嘛，哈利，想得到用牛粪石 （传说中此物能解百毒）
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.86,1:31:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定以教出这样的学生为傲吧，霍拉斯
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.40,1:31:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？哦，是，是，很自豪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.99,1:31:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都同意，波特的行为很英勇
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.91,1:31:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是，为什么会发生这种事？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.08,1:31:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.00,1:31:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这酒看起来是份礼物，霍拉斯
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.33,1:31:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得是谁送给你的了？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.34,1:31:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外，这酒要是没被下毒
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.47,1:31:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘草和樱桃的清香还是诱人的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.09,1:31:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上，我本来是打算把这个送人的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.39,1:31:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能问问，是送谁吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.60,1:31:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,送给您，校长
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.10,1:31:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.36,1:31:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小恩恩在哪？他有没有喊着要见我？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.53,1:31:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来这干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.37,1:32:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想问你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.78,1:32:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是他女朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.20,1:32:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是他…朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.12,1:32:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是笑掉大牙 你们都好几星期没说话了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.13,1:32:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他有意思了，你就想和好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.17,1:32:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他中毒了，你个蠢女人！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.05,1:32:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有，我一直都觉得他很有意思！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.56,1:32:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈，看到没？他感觉到我来了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.77,1:32:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没担心，小恩恩，我在这儿呢
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.73,1:32:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.41,1:32:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…赫敏…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.66,1:32:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.42,1:32:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.26,1:33:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，年轻真好，还能感受爱的伤害啊
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.51,1:33:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，大家，都走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.02,1:33:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯莱先生有人照顾了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.90,1:33:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是时候了，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.11,1:33:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.62,1:33:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别多话
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.75,1:35:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下，罗恩，你又把这弄得满是雪花了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.01,1:35:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,再跟我过一遍，我是怎么 跟拉文德分手的来着？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.51,1:35:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃，是这样…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.52,1:35:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来医院看你
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.39,1:35:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你说了些话
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.40,1:36:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的也不是太多了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.65,1:36:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别误会，能甩了她我高兴还来不及
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.11,1:36:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是她看起来，好像要发飙
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.96,1:36:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实啊，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.09,1:36:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天晚上之后的事情 你什么都不记得了？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.30,1:36:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都不记得？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.47,1:36:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有一些些
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.81,1:36:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过没可能了 那会我正晕着呢，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.77,1:36:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，晕着
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.24,1:36:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.95,1:36:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.08,1:36:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂·贝尔
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.38,1:37:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂，你感觉怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.43,1:37:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会问，哈利 但我真不知道是谁对我下的咒
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.56,1:37:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很努力想回忆
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.52,1:37:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,可就是记不起来
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.20,1:37:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.00,1:38:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道是你干的好事，马尔福 是你对她下咒，对不对？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.45,1:38:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,神锋无影！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.41,1:39:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,速速复原
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.00,1:39:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,速速复原
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.13,1:39:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,速速复原
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.11,1:40:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天就得扔了它
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.54,1:40:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,牵着我的手
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.14,1:40:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有求必应屋
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.52,1:40:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把混血王子的这本书…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.32,1:40:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏在一个谁也找不到的地方 包括你自己
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.37,1:41:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么声音？ - 什么声音？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.94,1:41:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.82,1:41:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里到处都是惊喜
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.01,1:42:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，闭上眼睛 这样你才不会被诱惑
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.76,1:42:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上眼睛
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.17,1:42:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你愿意，这个吻 也可以变成藏在这里的秘密
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.68,1:42:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和金妮干完事了？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.23,1:42:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.56,1:42:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏书啊
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.82,1:42:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，对
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.61,1:43:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天，忘了点东西
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.36,1:43:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯拉格霍恩那边还是运气不佳？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.20,1:43:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,运气
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.58,1:43:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了，我就是需要点运气
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.06,1:43:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉怎样？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.44,1:43:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.23,1:43:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的，太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.99,1:43:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.91,1:43:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯拉格霍恩通常很早吃晚饭
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.82,1:43:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后会散个步，之后就回办公室
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.99,1:43:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.91,1:43:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要去海格那 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.25,1:43:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行，哈利，你得去找斯拉格霍恩谈
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.50,1:44:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们都计划好了 - 我知道…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.26,1:44:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我觉得去海格那儿肯定有好事
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.51,1:44:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得，我今晚就是该去那里 明白我的意思吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.14,1:44:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不明白 - 好了，那就相信我吧，我知道自己在干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.56,1:44:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少福灵剂知道
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.97,1:44:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅林的胡子啊，是你，哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.84,1:44:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，教授，我本来该提示下 清清嗓子，咳嗽咳嗽之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.14,1:44:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,您大概以为我是斯普劳特教授吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.27,1:44:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真是，你怎么会这么想？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.85,1:45:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看您的样子就知道了，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.11,1:45:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么偷偷摸摸了 看到我还会吓一大跳了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.07,1:45:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是毒须草叶吗，教授？ 这些可是很珍贵的，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.82,1:45:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是找对买家，一片叶子能卖十加隆
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.32,1:45:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了，我对这种买卖根本不了解 只是听谣言罢了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.99,1:45:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对这个的兴趣纯粹是学术性的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.96,1:45:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西老是让我心里发毛
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.50,1:45:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么出城堡的，哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.84,1:45:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,从大门出来的啊，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.51,1:45:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去海格家，他是我的好朋友…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.84,1:45:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这会想去拜访他一下
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.72,1:45:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是不介意，我就先走了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.81,1:45:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.27,1:45:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了，教授？ - 这都快天黑了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.90,1:45:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让你一个人到处闲逛
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.52,1:45:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，这样啊，那您一起来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.45,1:45:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，我坚持，你马上跟我
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.83,1:45:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,回城堡去！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.75,1:46:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这一趟就白跑了，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.33,1:46:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这话什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.55,1:46:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.89,1:46:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍拉斯
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.93,1:46:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅林的胡子啊！这真是八眼巨蛛吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.81,1:46:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是真的死蜘蛛，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.69,1:46:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.86,1:46:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好家伙，你是怎么杀的它？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.24,1:46:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀它？它可是我的老朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.87,1:46:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉，我不知道… - 别放心上，不止你一个人（不喜欢蜘蛛）
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.58,1:46:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛这种生物，常常被人误解
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.21,1:46:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是因为眼睛吧，会让一些人害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.84,1:46:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那些长螯
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.09,1:46:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，大概也是原因吧
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.76,1:46:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格，我不想这个时候表现得铁石心肠
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.31,1:47:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但八眼巨蛛的毒液可是相当稀罕
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.56,1:47:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,能容我提取一两小瓶吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.94,1:47:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道我，纯粹是用于学术研究
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.73,1:47:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正它现在留着也没用了，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.82,1:47:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我想的一模一样
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.19,1:47:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是随身带几个安瓿瓶 就是为这种状况准备的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.95,1:47:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔药老师的老习惯了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.62,1:47:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望你能见到它当年的样子
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.25,1:47:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,雄伟极了，实在是雄伟极了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.34,1:47:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.64,1:47:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你愿意让我说几句悼词吗？ - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.10,1:47:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想，它有家人吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.81,1:47:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，那可不
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.65,1:47:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,永别了…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.32,1:47:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉贡
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.70,1:48:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,永别了，阿拉贡
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.00,1:48:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛之王，阿拉贡
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.50,1:48:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的肉体或将腐朽
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.34,1:48:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的灵魂必将永存
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.89,1:48:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此，你的人类朋友们 才会在经久的悲恸中寻得一丝宽慰
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.70,1:48:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它从一个蜘蛛蛋开始养大 刚出壳的时候还是个小不点
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.49,1:48:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,比只京巴狗大不了多少 你知道吧，京巴狗
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.37,1:48:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真美好，我以前有一条鱼，叫弗兰西斯 跟我可亲了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.71,1:48:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一天下午，我下楼一看，他就不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.05,1:48:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,“噗”，就不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.80,1:49:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很奇怪啊，不是吗？ - 就是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.18,1:49:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过，我想这就是人生吧
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.06,1:49:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你过着过着，突然，噗！就没了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.57,1:49:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噗 - 噗
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.79,1:49:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个学生送我弗兰西斯的
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.92,1:49:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个春日的午后 我看到我桌上有一口小碗
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.13,1:49:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面是浅浅的一汪清水
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.89,1:49:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,水面上，漂着一朵花瓣
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.98,1:49:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正看着，它却沉了下去
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.94,1:49:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在要碰到碗底的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.94,1:49:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它变形了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.78,1:50:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成了一条小鱼
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.28,1:50:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是美妙
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.41,1:50:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,赏心悦目
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.29,1:50:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那瓣花是百合
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.42,1:50:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你母亲一样美
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.51,1:50:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下楼的那天
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.97,1:50:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那碗空了的那天
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.80,1:50:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是你母亲…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.98,1:50:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你为什么在这
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.98,1:50:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我帮不了你
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.78,1:50:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮你会毁了我自己
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.20,1:50:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是怎么幸存下来的吗，教授？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.20,1:50:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我留下这疤的那天晚上
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.79,1:50:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为她
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.33,1:50:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她牺牲了自己
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.55,1:50:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她不愿为了活命离开我
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.09,1:51:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她的爱比伏地魔的法力更强大
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.47,1:51:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别说他名字 - 我不怕说这个名字，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.01,1:51:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉您一些事情吧
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.06,1:51:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些别人只是猜测的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.98,1:51:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.07,1:51:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是救世主
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.36,1:51:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我能打败他，但是在这之前…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.74,1:51:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须知道 汤姆·里德尔问了您什么问题
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.20,1:51:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须知道，您告诉了他什么
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.29,1:51:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢些，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.33,1:51:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我妈妈一样，勇敢些
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.71,1:51:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则，您只能给她蒙羞
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.50,1:51:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则，她的死毫无价值
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.80,1:51:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则，您心里的碗会永远空着
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.57,1:52:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你，看完这个之后，不要看低我
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.70,1:52:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使在当时，你也没法想象他的强大
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.74,1:52:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,前几天晚上我在图书馆
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.61,1:52:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,禁书区
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.66,1:52:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我读到一些关于某种罕见魔法的材料
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.58,1:52:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没记错，那东西叫…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.63,1:53:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,魂器
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.80,1:53:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？ - 魂器
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.97,1:53:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看书的时候，看到这个词
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.80,1:53:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是很懂
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.97,1:53:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆，我不知道你在看的是什么书
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.89,1:53:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是非常黑暗邪恶的东西，非常邪恶
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.64,1:53:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因此…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.31,1:53:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才来找您
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.98,1:53:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,魂器，是一种容器，隐藏着一个人的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.78,1:53:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想不出，怎么才办到的，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.99,1:53:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人把灵魂分裂出一部分 藏在一个容器里
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.17,1:53:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样，即使肉体遭到攻击甚至被毁 他仍被保护着
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.96,1:53:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.25,1:53:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那部分隐藏起来的灵魂会存活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.92,1:53:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,换言之，就是长生不死
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.52,1:54:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要怎么做才能分裂出灵魂，教授？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.85,1:54:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想，你已经知道答案了吧，汤姆
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.86,1:54:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.86,1:54:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.74,1:54:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮会令灵魂分离 这是对自然法则的违背
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.53,1:54:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能把灵魂分出来一次吗？ 比如，能不能分七次…？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.46,1:54:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,七次？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.71,1:54:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅林的胡子啊，汤姆 难道杀一个人还不够可怕吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.17,1:54:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是把灵魂分成七份…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.09,1:54:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都只是假设，对吧，汤姆？ 纯粹是学术探讨？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.89,1:54:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是自然，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.19,1:54:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当这是我们之间的小秘密
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.99,1:54:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.63,1:55:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我想象的还要糟糕
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.93,1:55:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,您是说，他成功了？ 他做出了一个魂器？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.76,1:55:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，他成功了，但不止是一个
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.06,1:55:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些到底是什么东西？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.27,1:55:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都有可能，可能是最不起眼的物件
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.77,1:55:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如，戒指
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.11,1:55:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者，笔记本
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.90,1:55:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 汤姆·里德尔的日记 - 没错，这就是一个魂器
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.78,1:55:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,四年前，你在密室救了金妮之后…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.08,1:55:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个带给我
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.54,1:55:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道这种魔法不一般
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.62,1:55:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常邪恶，非常强大 但直到今晚，我才知道它到底有多强大
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.79,1:55:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那这戒指？ - 是伏地魔母亲的
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.17,1:55:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,极难找到，但更难摧毁
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.09,1:55:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，如果谁能 把那些魂器全部找到并且销毁
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.14,1:56:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁就可能消灭伏地魔
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.47,1:56:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怎么找呢？他可能把这些藏在任何地方
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.56,1:56:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，但魔法，尤其是黑魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.79,1:56:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,会留下踪迹
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.46,1:56:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,您这些天就是去这些地方 是不是，教授？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.71,1:56:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是您不在学校的时候？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.84,1:56:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想，我可能又找到了一个
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.10,1:56:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这次，我没法一个人销毁它
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.73,1:56:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，我这次对你要求又太过分了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.36,1:56:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有想过你的要求太过分了…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.82,1:56:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把太多事当成理所应当的了？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.62,1:57:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那智慧的大脑，有没有想过 我不想再继续做这件事了？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.83,1:57:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有没有想过，与此事无关
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.83,1:57:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有商量的余地了，西弗勒斯 你已经同意，没什么好谈的了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.02,1:57:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.24,1:57:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该刮刮胡子了，朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.37,1:57:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道嘛，有时候 我都忘了你成长了这么多
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.74,1:57:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候，我还是能看到 那个壁橱里的小男孩
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.25,1:57:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我这番无病呻吟，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.09,1:57:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个老头了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.75,1:57:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来您一点没变，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.88,1:58:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你母亲一样，总是这么好心肠
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.05,1:58:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕，没人会忽视这一点
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.02,1:58:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚要去的地方，极度凶险
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.69,1:58:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应过你，让你随我去 我不会食言
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.36,1:58:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有一个条件
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.36,1:58:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须毫不犹豫得执行我所有指示
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.45,1:58:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.24,1:58:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白我的意思吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.95,1:58:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我若是让你躲，你就躲
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.62,1:58:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我若是让你跑，你就跑
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.12,1:58:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我若是让你别管我，救自己，你也必须照做
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.30,1:58:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你保证，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.51,1:58:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.81,1:58:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,扶着我手臂
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.89,1:58:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授，我们在霍格沃兹内 好像不能幻影移形吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.98,1:58:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵，当校长自然有当校长的好处
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.70,1:59:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这儿了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.12,1:59:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,错不了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.62,1:59:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在这里施过魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.21,2:00:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 教授！ - 要想找到入口
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.92,2:00:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须付出代价
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.51,2:00:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个能削弱来者实力的代价
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.72,2:00:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 您该让我来，教授 - 不行，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.01,2:00:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的血比我的珍贵太多了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.62,2:00:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔不会轻易让人发现 他隐藏灵魂的地方
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.42,2:00:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定会布下防范
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.34,2:00:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.28,2:01:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那儿了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.91,2:01:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是，我们怎么过去？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.81,2:01:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳驾帮个忙，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.94,2:02:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,您认为魂器就在这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.99,2:02:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，没错
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.46,2:02:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须喝光这些液体
Dialogue: 0,2:02:44.21,2:02:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点不剩
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.88,2:02:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得，我带你来之前 说的那个条件吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.38,2:02:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些液体，或许会让我失去行动能力
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.22,2:02:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许会让我忘记我来这里的目的
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.68,2:02:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许会让我无比痛苦 痛苦到令我向你哀求
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.23,2:03:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不要理会我的任何要求
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.31,2:03:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的使命，哈利 确保我喝光这些液体
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.02,2:03:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是要逼着我下咽，你也要做
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.94,2:03:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白了吗？ - 可是教授，为什么不让我喝？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.24,2:03:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我比你老，比你聪明 而你比我珍贵太多
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.58,2:03:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你健康，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.81,2:03:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.23,2:03:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.11,2:03:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.78,2:03:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授，你听得到我吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.57,2:03:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.17,2:04:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别，不要
Dialogue: 0,2:04:13.47,2:04:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,您一定要继续喝，您自己说的，记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.06,2:04:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停下 - 会停下的，会停下的
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.10,2:04:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但您得先继续喝 - 求你，别逼我
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.69,2:04:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起，教授 - 求求你
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.99,2:04:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀了我吧，杀了我吧！- 不！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.20,2:04:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的错
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.95,2:04:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.00,2:04:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的错
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.79,2:04:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,再喝一杯，教授，就一杯 喝完之后，我保证
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.84,2:04:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证，您说什么我都会去做
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.34,2:04:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我保证 - 不要
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.22,2:04:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,求您了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.74,2:05:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.33,2:05:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,水
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.38,2:05:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,水
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.67,2:05:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,水
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.97,2:05:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,您成功了，教授
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.93,2:05:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,您看
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.39,2:05:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.02,2:05:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,水
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.11,2:05:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,清水如泉
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.98,2:05:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,水
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.60,2:06:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,荧光闪烁
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.43,2:07:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,球状荧光！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.81,2:07:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.69,2:07:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,神锋无影！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.99,2:07:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.11,2:07:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 昏昏倒地！ - 哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:08:22.92,2:08:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.22,2:08:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,烈火熊熊！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.10,2:09:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,都回自己的学院去，别闲逛
Dialogue: 0,2:09:57.06,2:10:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去校医院，教授 去找庞弗雷夫人
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.19,2:10:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.61,2:10:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,西弗勒斯，我需要西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.45,2:10:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,去叫醒他，告诉他发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,2:10:12.16,2:10:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟其他人提起
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.45,2:10:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,找西弗勒斯，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:10:21.96,2:10:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快躲到楼下，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.84,2:10:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没我允许，不要出声 也不要被别人看到
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.01,2:10:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论发生了什么，都要记得 在下面躲好
Dialogue: 0,2:10:33.60,2:10:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，照我说的做
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.89,2:10:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.94,2:10:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我
Dialogue: 0,2:11:03.96,2:11:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安啊，德拉科
Dialogue: 0,2:11:06.67,2:11:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上天气这么好 你来这儿做什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,2:11:10.38,2:11:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁在这？我听到你和人说话了
Dialogue: 0,2:11:12.30,2:11:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我常常一个人自言自语 这习惯可相当有益
Dialogue: 0,2:11:18.52,2:11:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会自言自语吗，德拉科？
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.85,2:11:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉科…
Dialogue: 0,2:11:25.98,2:11:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不会杀人的 - 你怎么知道我会什么不会什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:11:29.11,2:11:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做过很多事，说出来吓死你
Dialogue: 0,2:11:31.07,2:11:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给凯蒂·贝尔下咒，想让她把项链送给我？
Dialogue: 0,2:11:35.37,2:11:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷换了瓶掺了毒物的蜜酒？ 诸如此类的事情？
Dialogue: 0,2:11:38.16,2:11:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言，德拉科
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.91,2:11:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的这些尝试太不用心了
Dialogue: 0,2:11:42.58,2:11:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明你的心思完全没有放在这里
Dialogue: 0,2:11:45.13,2:11:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他信任我，我被选中了
Dialogue: 0,2:11:52.13,2:11:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那，我就成全你吧
Dialogue: 0,2:11:54.09,2:11:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,除你武器！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:59.10,2:12:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，很好
Dialogue: 0,2:12:03.19,2:12:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是一个人在这
Dialogue: 0,2:12:05.73,2:12:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他人
Dialogue: 0,2:12:08.82,2:12:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办到的？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:11.53,2:12:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有求必应屋里的消失柜
Dialogue: 0,2:12:14.95,2:12:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我一直在修理它 - 我猜猜看
Dialogue: 0,2:12:17.49,2:12:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,它还有个姐妹柜，双子柜
Dialogue: 0,2:12:20.62,2:12:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在博金-博克，两个形成了一条通道
Dialogue: 0,2:12:23.00,2:12:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真天才
Dialogue: 0,2:12:25.46,2:12:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉科
Dialogue: 0,2:12:26.88,2:12:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多年前，我认识的一个孩子 他人生的每一个抉择都做错了
Dialogue: 0,2:12:33.88,2:12:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如今，让我帮你一次吧 - 我不用你帮！
Dialogue: 0,2:12:37.60,2:12:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不明白吗？我必须这么做
Dialogue: 0,2:12:42.31,2:12:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须杀了你
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.60,2:12:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不然他就会杀我
Dialogue: 0,2:12:56.16,2:12:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧我们逮着谁了
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.66,2:13:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好，德拉科
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.50,2:13:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好啊，贝拉特里克斯
Dialogue: 0,2:13:10.38,2:13:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你该给我介绍一下这几位吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:12.71,2:13:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想，阿不思，可惜今天时间有点紧
Dialogue: 0,2:13:18.47,2:13:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.14,2:13:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他根本没那胆子，跟他爹一样
Dialogue: 0,2:13:25.68,2:13:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是用我的办法来吧
Dialogue: 0,2:13:27.35,2:13:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！黑魔王的命令很明白 必须让马尔福下手
Dialogue: 0,2:13:31.15,2:13:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你荣耀，快动手
Dialogue: 0,2:13:34.74,2:13:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊，德拉科
Dialogue: 0,2:13:36.90,2:13:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就现在！
Dialogue: 0,2:13:40.32,2:13:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,2:13:53.55,2:13:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,2:14:04.10,2:14:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:06.56,2:14:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瓦达索命
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.29,2:15:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格！你躲哪了？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:15.92,2:15:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯内普！他信任你！
Dialogue: 0,2:15:24.30,2:15:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们走
Dialogue: 0,2:15:26.60,2:15:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,速速禁锢
Dialogue: 0,2:15:28.47,2:15:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还手啊！你这懦夫，还手！
Dialogue: 0,2:15:32.77,2:15:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！他是黑魔王的猎物
Dialogue: 0,2:15:56.13,2:15:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,神锋无影！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.97,2:16:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟敢拿我发明的魔咒来对付我，波特？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:11.98,2:16:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,2:16:13.85,2:16:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是混血王子
Dialogue: 0,2:20:06.09,2:20:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特
Dialogue: 0,2:20:08.25,2:20:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才发生的那些事
Dialogue: 0,2:20:12.17,2:20:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该找人谈谈
Dialogue: 0,2:20:17.43,2:20:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该知道，邓不利多教授
Dialogue: 0,2:20:23.27,2:20:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他来说，很重要
Dialogue: 0,2:20:44.00,2:20:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他下得了手吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:20:46.33,2:20:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉科？
Dialogue: 0,2:20:49.30,2:20:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会
Dialogue: 0,2:20:51.80,2:20:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会，他已经准备放下魔杖了
Dialogue: 0,2:20:54.88,2:20:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,到头来，还是斯内普
Dialogue: 0,2:20:57.47,2:20:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是斯内普
Dialogue: 0,2:21:00.10,2:21:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我却什么也做不成
Dialogue: 0,2:21:08.98,2:21:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是假的
Dialogue: 0,2:21:11.98,2:21:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开吧
Dialogue: 0,2:21:24.33,2:21:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,“致黑魔王：我知道 你读到这封信时，我早已死了
Dialogue: 0,2:21:28.50,2:21:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想让你知道，是我 发现了你的秘密
Dialogue: 0,2:21:33.17,2:21:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿走了真的魂器，并将尽快销毁
Dialogue: 0,2:21:37.22,2:21:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以死为代价，希望当你遇到敌手时
Dialogue: 0,2:21:40.43,2:21:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会是个血肉之躯的凡人
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.97,2:21:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,R.A.B.”
Dialogue: 0,2:21:46.89,2:21:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,R.A.B.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:48.73,2:21:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道是谁
Dialogue: 0,2:21:52.02,2:21:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不管他们是谁，真的魂器在他们手上
Dialogue: 0,2:21:55.65,2:21:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做的这一切，都是枉然
Dialogue: 0,2:21:58.53,2:22:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切的一切
Dialogue: 0,2:22:06.25,2:22:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩不介意了
Dialogue: 0,2:22:08.83,2:22:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于你跟金妮的事
Dialogue: 0,2:22:10.96,2:22:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我要是你，有他在场的时候 还是能少亲就少亲
Dialogue: 0,2:22:16.01,2:22:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会回来了，赫敏
Dialogue: 0,2:22:19.18,2:22:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论邓不利多开始的是什么使命 我都要去完成它
Dialogue: 0,2:22:22.05,2:22:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道这条路会引我去向何方
Dialogue: 0,2:22:25.06,2:22:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果可能，我会让你和罗恩 知道我到了什么地方
Dialogue: 0,2:22:30.02,2:22:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直很佩服你的勇气，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:22:32.82,2:22:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有时候，你也太傻气了
Dialogue: 0,2:22:38.53,2:22:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会真以为靠你一个人
Dialogue: 0,2:22:40.95,2:22:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能找到所有魂器吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:47.58,2:22:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要我们，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:23:05.06,2:23:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没注意过，原来这里的风景这么美
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I killed Sirius Black！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.69,0:02:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,The police are continuing with the investigation…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.56,0:03:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,…into the cause of the Millennium Bridge disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Traffic has been halted as police search for survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.65,0:03:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,The surrounding area remains closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.49,0:03:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,The mayor has urged Londoners to remain calm…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Harry Potter.」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.58,0:03:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's Harry Potter？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.88,0:03:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.42,0:03:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bit of a tosser，really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Funny，that paper of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.13,0:03:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Couple nights ago，I could've sworn I saw a picture move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.93,0:03:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Really？- Thought I was going around the twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，I was wondering… - Eleven。That's when I get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.19,0:03:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can tell me all about that tosser Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.87,0:04:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've been reckless this summer，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.29,0:04:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I like riding around on trains.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.58,0:04:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Takes my mind off things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rather unpleasant to behold，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.34,0:04:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,The tale is thrilling，if I say so myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,But now is not the time to tell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:04:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.31,0:05:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.15,0:05:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just Apparated，didn't I？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.82,0:05:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Indeed。Quite successfully too，I might add.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.16,0:05:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Most people vomit the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.95,0:05:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't imagine why.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.34,0:05:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome to the charming village of Budleigh Babberton.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.34,0:05:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，I assume，right about now，you're wondering why I brought you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.80,0:05:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Am I right？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.68,0:05:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，sir，after all these years，I just sort of go with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wands out，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.87,0:06:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Horace？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Horace？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.94,0:07:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Merlin's beard！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.61,0:07:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,No need to disfigure me，Albus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.07,0:07:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I must say you make a very convincing armchair，Horace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.78,0:07:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all in the upholstery。I come by the stuffing naturally。What gave me away？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.12,0:07:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dragon's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh。- Oh，yes，introductions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.67,0:07:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，I'd like you to meet an old friend and colleague of mine…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Horace Slughorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.46,0:07:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Horace…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.13,0:07:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…well，you know who this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.47,0:07:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.64,0:07:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's with all the theatrics，Horace？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.56,0:07:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,You weren't，by any chance，waiting for someone else？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.19,0:07:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone else？I'm sure I don't know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.11,0:07:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，the Death Eaters have been trying to recruit me for over a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.73,0:07:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know what that's like？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:08:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can only say no so many times，so I never stay anywhere more than a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Muggles who own this are in the Canary Islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.66,0:08:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I think we should put it back in order for them，don't you？Mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.32,0:08:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.03,0:08:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do you mind if I use the loo？- No，of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.37,0:08:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't think I don't know why you're here，Albus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.21,0:08:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,The answer's still no。Absolutely and unequivocally，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.10,0:09:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're very like your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.31,0:09:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Except for the eyes。You have your… - My mother's eyes。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.35,0:09:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lily。Lovely Lily。She was exceedingly bright，your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even more impressive when one considers she was Muggle-born.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.74,0:09:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,One of my best friends is Muggle-born。Best in our year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.49,0:09:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please don't think I'm prejudiced。No，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your mother was one of my absolute favorites。Look，there she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.08,0:09:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right at the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,All mine。Each and every one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.51,0:09:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ex-students，I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.76,0:09:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,You recognize Barnabas Cuffe，editor of The Daily Prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.10,0:09:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Always takes my owl，should I wish to register an opinion…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.77,0:09:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,…on the news of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.94,0:10:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gwenog Jones，captain of the Holyhead Harpies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.07,0:10:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Free tickets whenever I want them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.78,0:10:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course，I haven't been to a match in some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Regulus Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.45,0:10:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You no doubt know of his older brother Sirius。Died a few weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.58,0:10:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I taught the whole Black family，except Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.29,0:10:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a shame。Talented boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.67,0:10:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got Regulus when he came along，of course，but I'd have liked the set.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.84,0:10:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Horace？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.76,0:10:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I take this？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.85,0:10:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I do love knitting patterns。- Yes，of course。But you're not leaving？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.69,0:10:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I know a lost cause when I see one。Regrettable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.98,0:10:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would have considered it a personal triumph…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.45,0:10:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…had you consented to return to Hogwarts。Oh，well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.57,0:10:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're like my friend Mr。Potter here，one of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.20,0:10:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，bye-bye，Horace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.96,0:10:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.01,0:11:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.93,0:11:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I want Professor Merrythought's old office，not the water closet I had before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.68,0:11:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I expect a raise。These are mad times we live in。Mad！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.69,0:11:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,They are indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.74,0:11:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，exactly what was all that about？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are talented，famous and powerful。Everything Horace values.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.03,0:11:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Slughorn is gonna try to collect you，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.62,0:11:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,You would be his crowning jewel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.17,0:11:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why he's returning to Hogwarts。And it's crucial he should return.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.42,0:11:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I fear I may have stolen a wondrous night from you，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,She was，truthfully，very pretty，the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.93,0:11:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right，sir。I'll go back tomorrow，make some excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.56,0:12:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，you'll not be returning to Little Whinging tonight，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.40,0:12:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，sir，what about Hedwig？And my trunk？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.57,0:12:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Both are waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.73,0:12:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hedwig.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.86,0:12:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mum？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.48,0:12:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ginny，what is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was only wondering when Harry got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？Harry？Harry who？- Harry Potter，of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.12,0:12:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I'd know if Harry Potter was in my house，wouldn't I？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.45,0:13:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- His trunk's in the kitchen，and his owl。- No，dear，I seriously doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.58,0:13:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry？Did someone say 「Harry」？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.42,0:13:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me，nosy。Is he up there with you？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.55,0:13:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course not。I'd know if my best friend was in my room，wouldn't I？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.76,0:13:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is that an owl？- You haven't seen him，have you？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.43,0:13:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's wandering about the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.35,0:13:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Really？- Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.35,0:13:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.15,0:13:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.78,0:13:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,What a lovely surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why didn't you let us know you were coming？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.66,0:13:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I didn't know。Dumbledore。- Oh，that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.66,0:13:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,But then，what would we do without him？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.17,0:13:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got a bit of toothpaste.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.05,0:13:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,So when did you get here？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,A few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.26,0:14:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Though for a while，I wasn't sure I was coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.39,0:14:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mum sort of lost it last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.98,0:14:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Said Ginny and I had no business going back to Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.98,0:14:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,That it's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.52,0:14:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，come on。- She's not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.53,0:14:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even my parents，and they're Muggles，know something bad's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.03,0:14:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyway，Dad stepped in，told her she was being barmy…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.20,0:14:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and it took a few days，but she came around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.96,0:14:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,But this is Hogwarts we're talking about。It's Dumbledore。What could be safer？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.54,0:14:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's been a lot of talk recently that…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Dumbledore's got a bit old.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rubbish！Well，he's only…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.34,0:14:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is he？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.09,0:14:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hundred and fifty？Give or take a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.37,0:15:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cissy！You can't do this！He can't be trusted！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.37,0:15:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Dark Lord trusts him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Dark Lord's mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.87,0:15:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run along，Wormtail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know I ought not to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Dark Lord himself forbade me to speak of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.67,0:15:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,If the Dark Lord has forbidden it，you ought not to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put it down，Bella。We mustn't touch what isn't ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.89,0:16:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,As it so happens，I'm aware of your situation，Narcissa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,You？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.02,0:16:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Dark Lord told you？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.90,0:16:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your sister doubts me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.48,0:16:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Understandable。Over the years I've played my part well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.49,0:16:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,So well，I've deceived one of the greatest wizards of all time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.66,0:16:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dumbledore is a great wizard。Only a fool would question it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.75,0:16:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't doubt you，Severus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.83,0:16:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should be honored，Cissy。As should Draco.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.42,0:16:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's just a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't change the Dark Lord's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.80,0:16:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it might be possible for me to help Draco.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.23,0:16:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Severus。- Swear to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.23,0:16:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make the Unbreakable Vow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.53,0:17:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just empty words.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'll give it his best effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,But when it matters most…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.29,0:17:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,…he'll just slither back into his hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.47,0:17:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take out your wand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.24,0:17:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.57,0:17:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Severus Snape…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.78,0:17:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,…watch over Draco Malfoy…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.87,0:17:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,…as he attempts to fulfill the Dark Lord's wishes？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.83,0:17:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.13,0:18:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,And will you，to the best of your ability…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.47,0:18:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…protect him from harm？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.14,0:18:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.52,0:18:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if Draco should fail…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.14,0:18:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,…will you yourself carry out the deed…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.94,0:18:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the Dark Lord has ordered Draco to perform？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.20,0:18:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.48,0:18:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Step up！Step up！We've got Fainting Fancies！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.65,0:18:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nosebleed Nougats！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.85,0:19:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And just in time for school… - Puking Pastilles！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.28,0:19:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Into the cauldron，handsome。- Into the cauldron，handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.92,0:19:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Peruvian Instant Darkness Powder。- A real money spinner，that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.00,0:19:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Handy if you need to make a quick getaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.30,0:19:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello，ladies。- Hello，ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.22,0:19:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Love potions，eh？- Yeah，they really do work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.68,0:19:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then again，the way we hear it，sis，you're doing just fine on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.18,0:19:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Meaning？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.52,0:19:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you not currently dating Dean Thomas？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.10,0:19:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.61,0:19:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,How much for this？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.82,0:19:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Five Galleons。- Five Galleons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.36,0:19:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How much for me？- Five Galleons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.66,0:19:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.24,0:19:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ten Galleons。- Ten Galleons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.20,0:19:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.33,0:20:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.02,0:20:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,How are Fred and George doing it？Half the Alley's closed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.23,0:20:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fred reckons people need a laugh these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.27,0:20:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I reckon he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.03,0:20:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.24,0:20:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone got their wands from Ollivander's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.88,0:20:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.09,0:20:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it me，or do Draco and Mummy look like two people…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.34,0:20:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,…who don't want to be followed？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.28,0:22:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quibbler.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.41,0:22:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quibbler.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.87,0:22:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's lovely。They've been known to sing on Boxing Day，you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.71,0:22:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Quibbler？- Oh，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.30,0:22:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's a Wrackspurt？- They're invisible creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.01,0:22:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,They float in your ears and make your brain go fuzzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.72,0:22:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quibbler.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.73,0:23:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，what was Draco doing with that weird-looking cabinet？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.65,0:23:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,And who were all those people？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.53,0:23:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you see？It was a ceremony，an initiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.82,0:23:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop it，Harry。I know where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.91,0:23:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's happened。He's one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.58,0:23:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,One of what？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.83,0:23:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry is under the impression Draco Malfoy is now a Death Eater.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.46,0:23:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're barking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.59,0:23:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,What would You-Know-Who want with Malfoy？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.88,0:23:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，then what's he doing in Borgin and Burkes？Browsing for furniture？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.09,0:23:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a creepy shop。He's a creepy bloke.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.14,0:23:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，his father is a Death Eater。It only makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.18,0:23:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione saw it with her own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.93,0:23:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you，I don't know what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.98,0:23:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.25,0:24:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry。When we get to Hogwarts，we'll sort it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.44,0:24:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What was that？Blaise？- Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.86,0:24:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Relax，boys。It's probably just a first-year messing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.15,0:24:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Draco。Sit down。We'll be at Hogwarts soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.21,0:24:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hogwarts。What a pathetic excuse for a school.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.17,0:24:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd pitch myself off the Astronomy Tower…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.34,0:25:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,…if I had to continue for another two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.63,0:25:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.22,0:25:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's just say you won't see me wasting my time in Charms class next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.85,0:25:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amused，Blaise？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.15,0:25:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll see just who's laughing in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.71,0:25:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,You two go on。I wanna check something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.63,0:25:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's Harry？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.09,0:25:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's probably already on the platform。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.74,0:26:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Didn't Mummy ever tell you it was rude to eavesdrop，Potter？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.41,0:26:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Petrificus Totalus.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.09,0:26:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,…she was dead before you could wipe the drool off your chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.89,0:26:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's for my father。Enjoy your ride back to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.90,0:27:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finite.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.78,0:27:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello，Harry。- Luna！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.45,0:27:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How'd you know where I was？- Wrackspurts。Your head's full of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.87,0:27:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry I made you miss the carriages，by the way，Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.71,0:27:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's all right。It was like being with a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.05,0:27:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I am your friend，Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.51,0:27:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.47,0:27:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,About time。I've been looking all over for you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.85,0:27:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Names？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.93,0:27:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Flitwick，you've known me for five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.48,0:27:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No exceptions，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.15,0:28:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are those people？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.07,0:28:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aurors。For security.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.53,0:28:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's this cane here，then？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.28,0:28:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not a cane，you cretin。It's a walking stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.70,0:28:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what exactly would you be wanting with a…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.87,0:28:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could be construed as an offensive weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.12,0:28:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right，Mr。Filch。I can vouch for Mr。Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.76,0:28:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice face，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.27,0:28:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would you like me to fix it for you？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.77,0:28:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Personally，I think you look a bit more devil-may-care this way…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.73,0:28:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but it's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.69,0:28:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，have you ever fixed a nose before？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.15,0:28:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，but I've done several toes，and how different are they，really？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.91,0:28:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um… Okay，yeah。Give it a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.25,0:29:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Episkey。- Ah！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.42,0:29:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How do I look？- Exceptionally ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.72,0:29:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.48,0:29:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry。He'll be here in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.40,0:29:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you stop eating？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.28,0:29:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your best friend is missing！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.70,0:29:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oi。Turn around，you lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.75,0:29:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's covered in blood again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.87,0:29:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why is it he's always covered in blood？- Looks like it's his own this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.13,0:29:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where have you been？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.17,0:29:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What happened to your face？- Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.80,0:29:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,What've I missed？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.97,0:29:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorting Hat urged us all to be brave and strong in these troubled times.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.93,0:29:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Easy for it to say，huh？It's a hat，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.32,0:30:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very best of evenings to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.19,0:30:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.45,0:30:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,First off，let me introduce the newest member of our staff…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.28,0:30:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Horace Slughorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.42,0:30:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Slughorn，I'm happy to say…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.46,0:30:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,…has agreed to resume his old post as Potions Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.92,0:30:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Meanwhile，the post of Defense Against the Dark Arts…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.01,0:30:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…will be taken by Professor Snape.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.22,0:30:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Snape？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.73,0:30:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，as you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.52,0:30:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,…each and every one of you was searched upon your arrival here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.36,0:30:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you have the right to know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.15,0:30:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once there was a young man，who，like you…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.91,0:30:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…sat in this very hall…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.74,0:31:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,…walked this castle's corridors，slept under its roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.95,0:31:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,He seemed to all the world a student like any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.50,0:31:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,His name？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.50,0:31:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tom Riddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.01,0:31:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Today，of course…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.22,0:31:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,…he's known all over the world by another name.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.73,0:31:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which is why，as I stand looking out upon you all tonight…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.11,0:31:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I'm reminded of a sobering fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.65,0:31:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every day，every hour…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.95,0:31:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,…this very minute，perhaps…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.07,0:31:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…dark forces attempt to penetrate this castle's walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.04,0:31:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,But in the end，their greatest weapon is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.63,0:31:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just something to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.01,0:31:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，off to bed。Pip-pip.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.26,0:32:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was cheerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.35,0:32:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,History of Magic is upstairs，ladies，not down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.90,0:32:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Davies！Mr。Davies！That is the girls' lavatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.70,0:32:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.45,0:32:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，this can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.71,0:32:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enjoying ourselves，are we？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.00,0:32:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I had a free period this morning。- So I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.71,0:32:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would think you would want to fill it with Potions.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.30,0:32:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or is it no longer your ambition to become an Auror？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.76,0:32:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was，but I was told I had to get an 「Outstanding」 in my O.W.L.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.56,0:32:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you did，when Professor Snape was teaching Potions.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.60,0:32:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,However，Professor Slughorn is perfectly happy to accept N.E.W.T。s students…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.35,0:32:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,…with 「Exceeds Expectations.」
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.65,0:32:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brilliant。Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.48,0:32:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Well，I'll head there straightaway。- Oh，good，good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.11,0:33:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Potter，take Weasley with you。He looks far too happy over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.83,0:33:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't wanna take Potions.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.29,0:33:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Quidditch trials coming up。I need to practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.25,0:33:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attention to detail in the preparation…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.38,0:33:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,…is the prerequisite of all planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.71,0:33:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，my boy，I was beginning to worry。We've brought someone with us，I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.26,0:33:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron Weasley，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.01,0:33:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I'm dead awful at Potions，a menace，actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.64,0:33:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm gonna… - Nonsense，we'll sort you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.89,0:33:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any friend of Harry's is a friend of mine。Get your books out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.15,0:33:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I haven't actually got my book yet，and nor has Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.86,0:33:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get what you want from the cupboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.73,0:33:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，as I was saying，I prepared some concoctions this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.24,0:33:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any ideas what these might be？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.70,0:33:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes，Miss… - Granger，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.54,0:33:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,That one there is Veritaserum。It's a truth-telling serum.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.17,0:33:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,And that would be Polyjuice Potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.51,0:34:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's terribly tricky to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.34,0:34:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,And this is Amortentia…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.56,0:34:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the most powerful love potion in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.89,0:34:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's rumored to smell differently to each person according to what attracts them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.02,0:34:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,For example，I smell…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.77,0:34:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…freshly mown grass，and new parchment，and…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.99,0:34:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,…spearmint toothpaste.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.74,0:34:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amortentia doesn't create actual love。That would be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.37,0:34:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it does cause a powerful infatuation or obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.54,0:34:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,And for that reason，it is probably the most dangerous potion in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.76,0:34:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir？You haven't told us what's in that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.93,0:34:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.81,0:34:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,What you see before you，ladies and gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.56,0:35:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,…is a curious little potion known as Felix Felicis.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.40,0:35:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it is more commonly referred to as…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.82,0:35:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Liquid luck。- Yes，Miss Granger。Liquid luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.62,0:35:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Desperately tricky to make，disastrous should you get it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.41,0:35:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,One sip and you will find that all of your endeavors succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.46,0:35:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,At least until the effects wear off.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.80,0:35:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,So this is what I offer each of you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.80,0:35:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,One tiny vial of liquid luck to the student who，in the hour that remains…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.81,0:35:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,…manages to brew an acceptable Draught of Living Death…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.56,0:35:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the recipes for which can be found on page 10 of your books.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.98,0:35:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should point out，however，only once did a student manage to brew a potion…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.82,0:35:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,…of sufficient quality to claim this prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.82,0:35:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nevertheless，good luck to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.87,0:35:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let the brewing commence.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.49,0:36:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did you do that？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.87,0:36:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,You crush it。Don't cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.20,0:36:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。The instructions specifically say to cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.87,0:36:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，really.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.20,0:37:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Merlin's beard！It is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.87,0:37:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,So perfect I daresay one drop would kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.38,0:37:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,So here we are，then，as promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.51,0:37:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,One vial of Felix Felicis.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.89,0:37:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.43,0:37:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Use it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.79,0:38:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，you got my message。Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.13,0:38:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,How are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.68,0:38:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm fine，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.39,0:38:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enjoying your classes？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.89,0:38:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know Professor Slughorn is most impressed with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.64,0:38:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think he overestimates my abilities，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.64,0:38:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.31,0:38:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.57,0:38:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about your activities outside the classroom？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.61,0:38:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sir？- Well，I notice you spend…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.78,0:38:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…a great deal of time with Miss Granger.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.58,0:38:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't help wondering…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.99,0:38:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no，no。I mean，she's brilliant，and we're friends，but，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.16,0:38:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forgive me。I was merely being curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.25,0:38:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,But enough chitchat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.34,0:38:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must be wondering why I summoned you here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.51,0:38:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,The answer lies here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.35,0:38:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What you are looking at are memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.68,0:39:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,In this case，pertaining to one individual，Voldemort…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.69,0:39:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,…or，as he was known then，Tom Riddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.19,0:39:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,This vial contains the most particular memory…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.20,0:39:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…of the day I first met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.74,0:39:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like you to see it，if you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.16,0:40:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I admit some confusion upon receiving your letter，Mr。Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.74,0:40:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,In all the years Tom's been here，he's never once had a family visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.37,0:40:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,There have been incidents with the other children。Nasty things.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.55,0:40:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tom，you have a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.26,0:40:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you do，Tom？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.43,0:40:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.48,0:40:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're the doctor，aren't you？- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.78,0:40:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am a professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.53,0:40:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.53,0:40:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,She wants me looked at.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.12,0:40:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,They think I'm different.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.50,0:40:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，perhaps they're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.16,0:40:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.79,0:40:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hogwarts is not a place for mad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.29,0:40:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hogwarts is a school.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.05,0:40:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,A school of magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.72,0:41:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can do things，can't you，Tom？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.60,0:41:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Things other children can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.64,0:41:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can make things move without touching them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.52,0:41:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can make animals do what I want without training them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.90,0:41:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can make bad things happen to people who are mean to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.07,0:41:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can make them hurt…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.66,0:41:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,…if I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.74,0:41:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.79,0:41:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I'm like you，Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.17,0:41:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm different.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.67,0:41:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.68,0:41:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think there's something in your wardrobe trying to get out，Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.23,0:42:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thievery is not tolerated at Hogwarts，Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.20,0:42:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,At Hogwarts，you'll be taught not only how to use magic，but how to control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.03,0:42:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You understand me？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.16,0:42:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can speak to snakes too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.96,0:42:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,They find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.75,0:42:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whisper things.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.92,0:42:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that normal for someone like me？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.11,0:42:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you know，sir？Then？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.58,0:42:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did I know I'd just met the most dangerous dark wizard of all time？No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.79,0:42:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I had，I…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.54,0:43:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Over time，while here at Hogwarts…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.17,0:43:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Tom Riddle grew close to one particular teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.68,0:43:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you guess who that teacher might be？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.43,0:43:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,You didn't bring Professor Slughorn back simply to teach Potions，did you？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.06,0:43:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.27,0:43:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，Professor Slughorn possesses something I desire very dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.11,0:43:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,And he will not give it up easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.15,0:43:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,You said Professor Slughorn would try to collect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.53,0:43:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.49,0:43:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you want me to let him？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.87,0:43:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.41,0:44:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.29,0:45:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,This morning，I'm gonna be putting you all through a few drills…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.54,0:45:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…just to assess your strengths.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.38,0:45:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quiet！Please！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.55,0:45:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut it！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.55,0:45:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks。All right。Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.47,0:45:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just because you made the team last year…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.77,0:45:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,…does not guarantee you a spot this year。Is that clear？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.23,0:45:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.24,0:45:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,No hard feelings，Weasley，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.99,0:45:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hard feelings？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.37,0:45:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I'll be going out for Keeper as well。It's nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.08,0:45:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？Strapping guy like you？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.92,0:45:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've got more of a Beater's build，don't you think？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.67,0:45:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keepers need to be quick，agile.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.47,0:45:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I like my chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.43,0:45:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say，think you could introduce me to your friend Granger？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.39,0:45:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wouldn't mind getting on a first-name basis，know what I mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.86,0:46:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Weasley！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.74,0:46:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on，Ron！- Go on，Weasley！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.99,0:46:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go on，Weasley！- Yeah，Ron！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.04,0:46:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on，Cormac！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.81,0:46:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Ron！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.57,0:46:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.34,0:47:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Confundus.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.61,0:47:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't he brilliant？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.69,0:47:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to admit，I thought I was gonna miss that last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.53,0:47:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope Cormac's not taking it too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.74,0:47:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's got a bit of a thing for you，Hermione。Cormac.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.87,0:47:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's vile.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.84,0:47:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard of this spell？Sectumsempra？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.26,0:47:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.51,0:47:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if you had a shred of self-respect，you'd hand that book in.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.80,0:48:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not bloody likely。He's top of the class.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.43,0:48:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's even better than you，Hermione。Slughorn thinks he's a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.73,0:48:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.85,0:48:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like to know whose that book was。Let's have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.73,0:48:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.74,0:48:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why not？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.57,0:48:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,The binding is fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.36,0:48:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The binding is fragile？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.25,0:48:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who's the Half-Blood Prince？- Who？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.00,0:48:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what it says right here：「This book is property of the Half-Blood Prince.」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.10,0:48:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,For weeks you carry around this book，practically sleep with it…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.61,0:48:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,… yet you have no desire to find out who he is？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.07,0:48:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't say I wasn't curious，and I don't sleep with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.65,0:48:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.86,0:49:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I like a nice chat before I go to bed。Now all you do is read that bloody book.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.78,0:49:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just like being with Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.08,0:49:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I was curious，so I went to…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.75,0:49:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The library。- The library。And？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.21,0:49:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,And nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.00,0:49:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I couldn't find a reference anywhere to a Half-Blood Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.21,0:49:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There we go。That settles it，then。- Filius！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.47,0:49:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was hoping to find you in the Three Broomsticks！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.97,0:49:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，emergency choir practice，I'm afraid，Horace.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.14,0:49:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does anyone fancy a Butterbeer？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.90,0:49:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,A chum of mine was sledging down Claxby Hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.32,0:49:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,We had a very long，homemade，Norwegian-style sledge…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.11,0:49:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，not there。Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.20,0:49:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，sit beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.49,0:49:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.25,0:49:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something to drink？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.79,0:49:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three Butterbeers，and some ginger in mine，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.09,0:50:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.02,0:50:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Slick git.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.19,0:50:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honestly，Ronald，they're only holding hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.69,0:50:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,And snogging.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.61,0:50:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'd like to leave。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.74,0:50:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.49,0:50:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That happens to be my sister。- So？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.03,0:50:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,What if she looked over here and saw you snogging me？You expect her to leave？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.25,0:50:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，my boy！- Hello，sir。Wonderful to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.87,0:50:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you，and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.04,0:50:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，what brings you here？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.00,0:50:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Three Broomsticks and I go way back，further than I care to admit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.88,0:50:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can remember when it was One Broomstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.51,0:50:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,All hands on deck，Granger。Listen，my boy，in the old days…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.02,0:50:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I used to throw together the occasional supper party…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.60,0:50:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,…for the select student or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.98,0:50:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Would you be game？- I'd consider it an honor，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.28,0:51:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You would be welcome too，Granger.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.28,0:51:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'd be delighted，sir。- Splendid。Look for my owl.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.91,0:51:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good to see you，Wallenby.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.79,0:51:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you playing at？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.30,0:51:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dumbledore's asked me to get to know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.80,0:51:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get to know him？- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.93,0:51:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,It must be important。If it wasn't，Dumbledore wouldn't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.27,0:51:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got a little bit…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.28,0:51:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Katie，you don't know what it could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.33,0:51:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.95,0:51:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you hear what she said back at the pub about me and her snogging？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.25,0:51:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,As if.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.42,0:52:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I warned her。I warned her not to touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.24,0:52:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't get any closer。Get back，all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.50,0:52:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do not touch that，except by the wrappings。Do you understand？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.81,0:53:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're sure Katie did not have this in her possession…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.57,0:53:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,…when she entered the Three Broomsticks？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.70,0:53:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.45,0:53:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,She left to go to the loo，and when she came back she had the package.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.62,0:53:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,She said it was important that she deliver it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.16,0:53:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Did she say to whom？- To Professor Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.00,0:53:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very well。Thank you，Leanne。You may go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.38,0:53:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why is it when something happens it is always you three？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.97,0:53:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Believe me，professor，I've been asking myself the same question for six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.94,0:53:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,McGONAGALL：Oh，Severus.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.24,0:53:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you think？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.03,0:53:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think Miss Bell is lucky to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.00,0:53:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,She was cursed，wasn't she？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.41,0:54:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know Katie。Off the pitch，she wouldn't hurt a fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.58,0:54:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,If she was delivering that to Dumbledore，she wasn't doing it knowingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.34,0:54:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，she was cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.05,0:54:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.64,0:54:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is a very serious accusation，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.60,0:54:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.93,0:54:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Your evidence？- I just know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.10,0:54:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.32,0:54:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,…know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.78,0:54:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,You astonish with your gifts，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.86,0:54:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gifts mere mortals can only dream of possessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.99,0:54:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,How grand it must be to be the Chosen One.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.80,0:54:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I suggest you go back to your dormitories。All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.81,0:55:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you suppose Dean sees in her？Ginny？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.44,0:55:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，what does she see in him？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.61,0:55:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean？He's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.99,0:55:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You called him a slick git not five hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.99,0:55:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，well，he was running his hands all over my sister，wasn't he？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.95,0:55:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something snaps，and you've gotta hate him，you know？On principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.16,0:55:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.92,0:55:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So，what is it he sees in her？- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.84,0:55:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's smart，funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.01,0:55:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Attractive。- Attractive？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.85,0:55:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You know，she's got nice skin。- Skin？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.18,0:55:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean dates my sister because of her skin？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.19,0:55:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，no，I mean，I'm just saying it could be a contributing factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.07,0:55:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione's got nice skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.53,0:55:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you say？As skin goes，I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.24,0:55:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've never really thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.87,0:56:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，I suppose，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.33,0:56:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.21,0:56:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I think I'll be going to sleep now。- Right。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.43,0:56:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,So tell me，Cormac，do you see anything of your Uncle Tiberius these days？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.56,0:56:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir。In fact，I'm meant to go hunting with him…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.23,0:56:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and the Minister for Magic over the holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.61,0:56:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，be sure to give them both my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.74,0:56:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about your uncle，Belby？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.91,0:56:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,For those who don't know，Marcus' uncle invented the Wolfsbane Potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.53,0:56:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is he working on anything new？- Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.50,0:56:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Him and Dad don't get on。Probably because me dad says potions are rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.75,0:56:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Says the only potion worth having is a stiff one at the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.21,0:56:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about you，Miss Granger？What does your family do in the Muggle world？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.09,0:56:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,My parents are dentists.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.47,0:57:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,They tend to people's teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.93,0:57:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fascinating。And is that considered a dangerous profession？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.86,0:57:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.11,0:57:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Although，one boy，Robbie Fenwick，did bite my father once.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.78,0:57:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,He needed 10 stitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.29,0:57:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah。Miss Weasley。Come in，come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.63,0:57:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at her eyes。They've been fighting again，her and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.21,0:57:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry。I'm not usually late.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.72,0:57:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,No matter。You're just in time for dessert，that is，if Belby's left you any.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.07,0:57:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.32,0:57:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.28,0:58:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goodbye。Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.79,0:58:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Potter。- I'm sorry，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.71,0:58:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was just admiring your hourglass.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.67,0:58:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.68,0:58:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,A most intriguing object.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.39,0:58:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,The sand runs in accordance with the quality of the conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.93,0:58:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,If it is stimulating，the sand runs slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.69,0:58:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- If it is not… - I think I'll be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.77,0:58:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nonsense。You have nothing to fear，dear boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.28,0:58:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,As to some of your classmates…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.69,0:58:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,…well，let's just say they're unlikely to make the shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.28,0:58:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,The shelf，sir？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.37,0:58:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyone who aspires to be anyone hopes to end up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.16,0:58:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,But then again，you already are someone，aren't you，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.58,0:58:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did Voldemort ever make the shelf，sir？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.71,0:59:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You knew him，didn't you，sir，Tom Riddle？You were his teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.72,0:59:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Riddle had a number of teachers whilst here at Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.39,0:59:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,What was he like？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.69,0:59:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，sir。Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.73,0:59:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,He killed my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.32,0:59:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.99,0:59:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's only natural you should want to know more.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.08,0:59:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid I must disappoint you，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.83,0:59:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I first met Mr。Riddle，he was a quiet…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.25,0:59:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,…albeit brilliant，boy committed to becoming a first-rate wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.67,0:59:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not unlike others I've known.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.01,0:59:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not unlike yourself，in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.43,0:59:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,If the monster existed…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.05,0:59:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,…it was buried deep within.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.61,1:00:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good luck，eh，Ron.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.53,1:00:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nice hat！- Ron，you're a loser.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.16,1:00:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you，Ron。I have two Galleons on Gryffindor，yeah？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.41,1:00:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Looking good，Ron。- Loser！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.96,1:00:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's he wearing？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.10,1:00:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,So how was it，then？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.14,1:00:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How was what？- Your dinner party？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.64,1:00:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pretty boring，actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.06,1:00:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Though I think Harry enjoyed dessert.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.82,1:00:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Slughorn's having a Christmas do，you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.74,1:00:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we're meant to bring someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.45,1:00:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I expect you'll be bringing McLaggen。He's in the Slug Club，isn't he？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.33,1:00:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Actually，I was going to ask you。- Really？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.00,1:00:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good luck today，Ron.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.83,1:01:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know you'll be brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.22,1:01:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm resigning。After today's match，McLaggen can have my spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.14,1:01:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.80,1:01:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Juice？- Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.47,1:01:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.43,1:01:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,You look dreadful，Ron.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.69,1:01:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that why you put something in his cup？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.28,1:01:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it a tonic？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.36,1:01:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Liquid luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.37,1:01:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't drink it，Ron.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.63,1:01:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You could be expelled for that。- I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.21,1:01:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Harry。We've got a game to win.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.99,1:02:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on，Ron！Do it！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.78,1:02:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Weasley！Weasley！Weasley！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.08,1:02:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Weasley！Weasley！Weasley！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.84,1:03:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Weasley！Weasley！Weasley！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.14,1:03:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't have done it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.02,1:03:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know。I suppose I could've just used a Confundus Charm.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.02,1:03:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was different。That was tryouts。This was an actual game.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.45,1:03:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,You didn't put it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.87,1:03:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron only thought you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.50,1:04:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charms spell。I'm just practicing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.72,1:04:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，they're really good.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.06,1:04:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,How does it feel，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.90,1:04:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,When you see Dean with Ginny？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.20,1:04:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.74,1:04:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see the way you look at her.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.62,1:05:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.34,1:05:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.59,1:05:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think this room's taken.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.59,1:05:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's with the birds？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.39,1:05:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oppugno.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.13,1:05:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,It feels like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.54,1:06:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I can't help it if she's got her knickers in a twist.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.76,1:06:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,What Lav and I have，well，let's just say，there's no stopping it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.01,1:06:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's chemical.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.60,1:06:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will it last？Who knows？Point is，I'm a free agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.10,1:06:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's at perfect liberty to kiss whoever he likes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.10,1:06:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really couldn't care less.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.69,1:06:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was I under the impression he and I would be attending Slughorn's Christmas party？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.69,1:07:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.36,1:07:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，given the circumstances，I've had to make other arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.95,1:07:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.33,1:07:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Why？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.50,1:07:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just thought，seeing as neither of us can go with who we'd really like to…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.29,1:07:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,…we should go together，as friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.71,1:07:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why didn't I think of that？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.50,1:07:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you going with？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.21,1:07:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um，it's a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.17,1:07:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyway，it's you we've got to worry about。You can't just take anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.01,1:07:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,See that girl over there？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.52,1:07:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's Romilda Vane。Apparently she's trying to smuggle you a love potion.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.40,1:07:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.86,1:07:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！She's only interested in you because she thinks you're the Chosen One.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.48,1:07:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I am the Chosen One.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.36,1:07:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，sorry。Um，kidding.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.24,1:07:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll ask someone I like.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.49,1:07:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.80,1:08:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've never been to this part of the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.01,1:08:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,At least not while awake。I sleepwalk，you see.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.43,1:08:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why I wear shoes to bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.13,1:08:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harmonia Nectere Passus.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.64,1:08:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harmonia Nectere Passus.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.94,1:09:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harmonia Nectere Passus.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.25,1:09:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drink？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.58,1:09:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Neville.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.09,1:09:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't get into the Slug Club.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.71,1:09:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay，though。He's got Belby handing out towels in the loo.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.01,1:09:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，well，I'm fine，mate。Thanks。- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.23,1:09:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione。What are you doing？And what happened to you？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.36,1:09:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've just escaped。I mean，left Cormac under the mistletoe.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.82,1:09:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cormac？That's who you invited？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.03,1:09:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought it would annoy Ron the most.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.37,1:09:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you。I'll catch up with you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.54,1:09:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's got more tentacles than a Snarfalump plant.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.71,1:10:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dragon tartare？- No，I'm fine。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.04,1:10:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just as well。They give one horribly bad breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.88,1:10:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,On second thoughts…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.88,1:10:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Might keep Cormac at bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.22,1:10:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God，here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.68,1:10:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think she just went to powder her nose.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.73,1:10:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Slippery little minx，your friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.98,1:10:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Likes to work her mouth too，doesn't she？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.73,1:10:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is this I'm eating，by the way？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.90,1:10:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dragon balls.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.75,1:10:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've just bought yourself a month's detention，McLaggen.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.05,1:10:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not so quick，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.47,1:10:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，I really think I should rejoin the party。My date…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.76,1:10:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can surely survive your absence for another minute or two.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.85,1:11:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Besides，I only wish to convey a message.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.73,1:11:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- A message？- From Professor Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.15,1:11:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,He asked me to give you his best，and he hopes you enjoy your holiday.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.98,1:11:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.69,1:11:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,…he's traveling，and he won't return until term resumes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.41,1:11:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Traveling where？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.08,1:11:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take your hands off me，you filthy Squib！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.09,1:11:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Slughorn，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.96,1:11:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just discovered this boy lurking in an upstairs corridor.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.47,1:11:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,He claims to have been invited to your party.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.68,1:11:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，okay。I was gatecrashing。Happy？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.20,1:11:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll escort him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.83,1:11:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Certainly，professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.13,1:11:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，everyone，carry on，carry on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.46,1:12:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe I did hex that Bell girl。Maybe I didn't。What's it to you？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.55,1:12:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I swore to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.80,1:12:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I made the Unbreakable Vow.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.31,1:12:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't need protection.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.64,1:12:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was chosen for this。Out of all others。Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.73,1:12:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And I won't fail him。- You're afraid，Draco.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.86,1:12:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,You attempt to conceal it，but it's obvious。Let me assist you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.95,1:12:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.74,1:12:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was chosen。This is my moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.59,1:12:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Unbreakable Vow.」
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.34,1:12:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're sure that's what Snape said？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.14,1:12:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Positive。Why？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.60,1:12:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it's just you can't break an Unbreakable Vow.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.27,1:12:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd worked that much out for myself，funnily enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.11,1:12:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.48,1:12:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.34,1:13:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I miss you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.02,1:13:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.73,1:13:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,All she wants to do is snog me。My lips are getting chapped。Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.19,1:13:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll take your word for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.49,1:13:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，what happens to you？What happens if you break an Unbreakable Vow？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.00,1:13:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You die.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.29,1:14:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，the pudding's still here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.42,1:14:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Voldemort has chosen Draco Malfoy for a mission？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.93,1:14:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know it sounds mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.18,1:14:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Has it occurred to you Snape was simply pretending to offer Draco help…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.85,1:14:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,…so he could find out what he was up to？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.52,1:14:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's not what it sounded like。- Perhaps Harry's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.06,1:14:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,To make an Unbreakable Vow，it's…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.86,1:14:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,It comes down to whether or not you trust Dumbledore's judgment.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.53,1:14:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dumbledore trusts Snape，therefore I do。- Dumbledore can make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.78,1:14:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're blinded by hatred.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.11,1:14:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm not。- Yes，you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.91,1:14:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,People are disappearing，Harry，daily.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.08,1:14:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,We place our trust in a handful of people.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.21,1:14:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we start fighting amongst ourselves，we're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.65,1:15:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open up，you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.86,1:15:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you trust me？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.75,1:15:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.75,1:15:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I'll just… Get… Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.34,1:15:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Pie？- Not for me，no.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.06,1:15:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll have to forgive Remus.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.86,1:15:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,It takes its toll，his condition.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.61,1:15:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you all right，Mr。Weasley？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.82,1:15:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're being followed，all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.53,1:15:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Most days，Molly doesn't leave the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.87,1:15:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not been easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.96,1:16:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you get my owl？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.54,1:16:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.13,1:16:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,If Dumbledore's traveling，then that's news to the Ministry…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.34,1:16:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but perhaps that's the way Dumbledore wants it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.51,1:16:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,As for Draco Malfoy…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.64,1:16:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I know a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.43,1:16:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go on。- I sent an agent to Borgin and Burkes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.64,1:16:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think，from what you described…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.15,1:16:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,…what you and Ron saw in summer…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.98,1:16:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the object that Draco is so interested in…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.65,1:16:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,…is a vanishing cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.03,1:16:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,A vanishing cabinet？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.49,1:16:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,They were all the rage when Voldemort first rose to power.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.66,1:16:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can see the appeal。Should Death Eaters come knocking…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.79,1:16:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,…one simply had to slip inside and disappear for an hour or two.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.17,1:16:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,They can transport you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.09,1:16:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tricky contraptions though，very temperamental.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.63,1:16:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened to it？The one at Borgin and Burkes？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.72,1:16:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.68,1:16:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's still there.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.48,1:17:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was delicious，Molly，really.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.36,1:17:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you sure you won't stay？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.86,1:17:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，we should go。The first night of the cycle's always the worst.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.41,1:17:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remus？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.38,1:17:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.22,1:17:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Has Ron gone to bed？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.14,1:17:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um… Not yet。No.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.77,1:17:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shoelace.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.70,1:17:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.99,1:18:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.80,1:18:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry，no！- Remus！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.94,1:18:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ginny！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.53,1:18:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I killed Sirius Black！I killed Sirius Black！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.37,1:18:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,You coming to get me？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.70,1:18:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，can you get me？You coming to get me？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.78,1:19:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.67,1:19:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stupefy！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.20,1:20:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.46,1:20:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ginny！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.24,1:20:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Molly.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.72,1:21:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's easy for them to get to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.60,1:21:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're bloody lucky you weren't killed。You have to realize who you are，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.90,1:21:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know who I am，Hermione，all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.40,1:21:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.28,1:21:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lav，come on。Of course I'll wear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.78,1:21:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's my Won-Won.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.95,1:21:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，I have to go and vomit.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.02,1:21:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like to know where you get your information.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.48,1:21:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,More knowledgeable than half the staff，you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.15,1:22:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.15,1:22:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,…is it true that Professor Merrythought is retiring？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.16,1:22:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，Tom。I couldn't tell you if I knew，could I？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.20,1:22:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,By the way，thank you for the pineapple。You're quite right，it is my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.96,1:22:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,But how did you know？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.08,1:22:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Intuition.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.79,1:22:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gracious。Is it that time already？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.67,1:22:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Off you go，boys，or Professor Dippet will have us all in detention.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.47,1:22:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look sharp，Tom。Don't want to be caught out of bed after hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.22,1:22:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is something on your mind，Tom？- Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.64,1:22:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，I couldn't think of anyone else to go to.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.40,1:22:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,The other professors，well，they're not like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.78,1:22:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,They might misunderstand.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.99,1:22:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.37,1:23:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was in the library the other night…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.20,1:23:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,…in the Restricted Section…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.16,1:23:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and I read something rather odd about a bit of rare magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.63,1:23:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I thought perhaps you could illuminate me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.30,1:23:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's called，as I understand it…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.01,1:23:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.35,1:23:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about such things，and if I did，I wouldn't tell you！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.10,1:23:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，get out of here at once，and don't let me ever catch you mentioning it again！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.86,1:23:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Confused？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.69,1:23:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd be surprised if you weren't.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.11,1:23:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I don't understand。What happened？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.03,1:23:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is perhaps the most important memory I've collected.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.03,1:23:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is also a lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.70,1:23:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,This memory has been tampered with…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.66,1:23:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,…by the same person whose memory it is，our old friend，Professor Slughorn.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.67,1:23:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,But why would he tamper with his own memory？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.84,1:23:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I suspect he's ashamed of it。- Why？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.88,1:23:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why，indeed？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.18,1:24:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I asked you to get to know Professor Slughorn，and you have done so.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.72,1:24:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now I want you to persuade him to divulge his true memory…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.52,1:24:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,…any way you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.23,1:24:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know him that well，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.65,1:24:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,This memory is everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.07,1:24:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Without it，we are blind.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.57,1:24:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Without it，we leave the fate of our world to chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.25,1:24:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.29,1:24:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must not fail.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.38,1:24:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I'd highly recommend you reacquaint yourself…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.89,1:24:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,…with the chapter on antidotes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.51,1:24:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll tell you more about bezoars in our next class。Right，off you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.43,1:24:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alys，don't forget your rat tail.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.40,1:24:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aha。If it isn't the Prince of Potions himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.36,1:25:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,To what do I owe this pleasure？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.45,1:25:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，I wondered if I might ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.70,1:25:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ask away，dear boy，ask away.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.12,1:25:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,The other day I was in the library，in the Restricted Section…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.29,1:25:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and I came across something rather odd about a very rare piece of magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.29,1:25:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。And what was this rare piece of magic？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.13,1:25:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I don't know。I can't remember the name exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.63,1:25:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,It got me wondering，are there some kinds of magic you're not allowed to teach us？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.97,1:25:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Potions Master，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.48,1:25:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think your question'd better be posed to Professor Snape.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.48,1:25:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Um…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.56,1:25:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,He and I don't exactly see eye to eye，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.23,1:25:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,What I mean to say is…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.86,1:25:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,…well，he's not like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.32,1:25:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,He might misunderstand.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.45,1:25:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。There can be no light without the dark.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.45,1:25:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,And so it is with magic。Myself，I always strive to live within the light.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.12,1:25:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I suggest you do the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.17,1:25:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that what you told Tom Riddle，when he came asking questions？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.14,1:26:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dumbledore put you up to this，didn't he？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.18,1:26:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Didn't he？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.19,1:26:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.86,1:26:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，it's you，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.16,1:26:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，I'm busy at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.34,1:26:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's beautiful，isn't it？The moon.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.13,1:26:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Divine.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.22,1:26:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Had ourselves a little late-night snack，did we？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.64,1:26:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was on your bed，the box。I just thought I'd try one.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.39,1:26:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Or 20。- I can't stop thinking about her，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.06,1:26:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honestly，I reckoned she was annoying you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.23,1:27:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,She could never annoy me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.36,1:27:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I love her.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.49,1:27:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.62,1:27:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think she knows I exist？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.42,1:27:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope so。She's been snogging you for three months.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.08,1:27:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Snogging？Who are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.96,1:27:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.97,1:27:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Romilda，of course。Romilda Vane.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.76,1:27:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，very funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.39,1:27:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What was that for？- It's no joke！I'm in love with her！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.23,1:27:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine，you're in love with her。Have you ever actually met her？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.07,1:27:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Can you introduce me？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.71,1:28:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Ron。I'm gonna introduce you to Romilda Vane.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.23,1:28:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，sir。I wouldn't bother you if it weren't absolutely essential.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.78,1:28:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's Romilda？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.36,1:28:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's the matter with Wenby？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.82,1:28:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very powerful love potion.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.82,1:28:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very well。Better bring him in.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.37,1:28:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd have thought you could whip up a remedy for this in no time，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.83,1:28:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I thought this called for a more practiced hand，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.92,1:28:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，darling。Fancy a drink？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.17,1:28:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.34,1:28:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，by the way，professor，about earlier today，our misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.93,1:29:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，not at all。All water under the bridge，you know？Correct？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.48,1:29:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I expect you're tired of it after all these years.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.56,1:29:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,All the questions about Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.32,1:29:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't use that name.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.87,1:29:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,There you are，old boy。Bottoms up.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.12,1:29:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's this？- Tonic for the nerves.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.76,1:29:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What happened to me？- Love potion.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.22,1:29:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,A bloody strong one at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.94,1:29:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I feel really bad。- You need a pick-me-up.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.73,1:29:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got Butterbeer，wine，dazzling oak-matured mead.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.57,1:29:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had other intentions for this，but I think，given the circumstances…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.20,1:29:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here we are，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.08,1:29:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,To life！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.37,1:30:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.88,1:30:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron。Professor，do something.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.42,1:30:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.44,1:30:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Ron，breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.47,1:30:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,These girls，they're gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.31,1:31:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quick thinking on your part，Harry，using a bezoar.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.86,1:31:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must be very proud of your student，Horace.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.40,1:31:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hm？Oh，yes，very proud.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.99,1:31:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think we agree，Potter's actions were heroic.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.91,1:31:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,The question is，why were they necessary？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.08,1:31:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why，indeed？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.00,1:31:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,This appears to be a gift，Horace.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.33,1:31:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't remember who gave you this bottle？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.34,1:31:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which，by the way，possesses remarkably subtle hints of licorice and cherry…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.47,1:31:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…when not polluted with poison.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.09,1:31:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually I had intended to give it as a gift myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.39,1:31:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,To whom，I might ask？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.60,1:31:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,To you，Headmaster.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.10,1:31:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is he？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.36,1:31:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's my Won-Won？Has he been asking for me？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.53,1:31:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's she doing here？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.37,1:32:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I might ask you the same question.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.78,1:32:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I happen to be his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.20,1:32:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I happen to be his friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.12,1:32:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh。You haven't spoken in weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.13,1:32:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I suppose you want to make up now that he's all interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.17,1:32:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's been poisoned，you daft dimbo！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.05,1:32:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,And for the record，I've always found him interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.56,1:32:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah。See？He senses my presence.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.77,1:32:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry，Won-Won。I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.73,1:32:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.41,1:32:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh… Hermione…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.66,1:32:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.42,1:32:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.26,1:33:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，to be young，and to feel love's keen sting.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.51,1:33:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，come away，everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.02,1:33:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Weasley is well tended.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.90,1:33:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,About time，don't you think？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.11,1:33:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.62,1:33:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.75,1:35:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop it，Ron。You're making it snow.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.01,1:35:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me how I broke up with Lavender again.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.51,1:35:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um，well…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.52,1:35:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,…she came to visit you in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.39,1:35:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you talked.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.40,1:36:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't believe it was a particularly long conversation.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.65,1:36:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong，I'm bloody thrilled to be shot of her.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.11,1:36:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just she seems a bit put out.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.96,1:36:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，she does，doesn't she？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.09,1:36:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,You say you don't remember anything from that night？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.30,1:36:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything at all？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.47,1:36:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is something.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.81,1:36:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it can't be。I was completely boggled，wasn't I？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.77,1:36:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Boggled.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.24,1:36:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.95,1:36:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's Katie.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.08,1:36:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Katie Bell.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.38,1:37:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Katie。How are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.43,1:37:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know you're going to ask，Harry，but I don't know who cursed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.56,1:37:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been trying to remember，honestly.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.52,1:37:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.20,1:37:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Katie？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.00,1:38:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know what you did，Malfoy。You hexed her，didn't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.45,1:38:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sectumsempra！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.41,1:39:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vulnera Sanentur.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.00,1:39:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vulnera Sanentur.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.13,1:39:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vulnera Sanentur.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.11,1:40:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have to get rid of it。Today.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.54,1:40:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take my hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.14,1:40:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Room of Requirement.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.52,1:40:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need to hide the Half-Blood Prince's book…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.32,1:40:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,…where no one will ever find it，including you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.37,1:41:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What was that？- What was that？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.94,1:41:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,See？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.82,1:41:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,You never know what you'll find up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.01,1:42:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，close your eyes。That way you can't be tempted.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.76,1:42:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.17,1:42:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,That can stay hidden up here too，if you like.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.68,1:42:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,So did you and Ginny do it，then？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.23,1:42:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.56,1:42:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，hide the book？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.82,1:42:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.61,1:43:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah。Dear，yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.36,1:43:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still no luck with Slughorn，then，I take it？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.20,1:43:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.58,1:43:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it。All I need's a bit of luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.06,1:43:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，how do you feel？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.44,1:43:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.23,1:43:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.99,1:43:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.91,1:43:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Slughorn usually eats early…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.82,1:43:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,…takes a walk，and then returns to his office.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.99,1:43:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.91,1:43:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm going down to Hagrid's。- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.25,1:43:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Harry，you've got to go and speak to Slughorn.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.50,1:44:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We have a plan。- I know…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.26,1:44:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but I've got a good feeling about Hagrid's.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.51,1:44:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I feel it's the place to be tonight。Do you know what I mean？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.14,1:44:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。- Well，trust me，I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.56,1:44:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or Felix does.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.97,1:44:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Merlin's beard，Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.84,1:44:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，sir。I should've announced myself。Cleared my throat，coughed.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.14,1:44:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You probably feared I was Professor Sprout.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.27,1:44:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I did，actually。What makes you think that？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.85,1:45:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，just the general behavior，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.11,1:45:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,The sneaking around，the jumping when you saw me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.07,1:45:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are those Tentacula leaves，sir？They're very valuable，aren't they？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.82,1:45:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ten Galleons a leaf to the right buyer.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.32,1:45:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not that I'm familiar with any such transactions，but one does hear rumors.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.99,1:45:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,My own interests are purely academic，of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.96,1:45:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Personally，these plants always kind of freaked me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.50,1:45:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did you get out of the castle，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.84,1:45:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Through the front door，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.51,1:45:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm off to Hagrid's。He's a very dear friend…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.84,1:45:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and I fancied paying him a visit.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.72,1:45:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,So if you don't mind，I will be going now.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.81,1:45:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.27,1:45:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sir？- It's nearly nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.90,1:45:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Surely you realize I can't allow you to go roaming the grounds by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.52,1:45:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，then，by all means，come along，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.45,1:45:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，I must insist you accompany me…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.83,1:45:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,…back to the castle immediately！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.75,1:46:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,That would be counterproductive，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.33,1:46:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what makes you say that？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.55,1:46:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.89,1:46:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Horace.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.93,1:46:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Merlin's beard。Is that an actual Acromantula？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.81,1:46:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,A dead one，I think，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.69,1:46:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good God.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.86,1:46:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dear fellow，however did you manage to kill it？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.24,1:46:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill it？Me oldest friend，he was.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.87,1:46:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm so sorry，I didn't… - Don't worry yourself，you're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.58,1:46:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seriously misunderstood creatures，spiders are.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.21,1:46:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the eyes，I reckon。They unnerve some folk.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.84,1:46:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not to mention the pincers.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.09,1:46:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I reckon that too.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.76,1:46:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid，the last thing I wish to be is indelicate…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.31,1:47:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but Acromantular venom is uncommonly rare.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.56,1:47:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would you allow me to extract a vial or two？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.94,1:47:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Purely for academic purposes，you understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.73,1:47:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I don't suppose it's going to do him much good now，is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.82,1:47:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,My thoughts exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.19,1:47:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Always have a ampoule or two about my person for just such occasions as this.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.95,1:47:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Old Potions Master's habit，you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.62,1:47:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wish you could've seen him in his prime.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.25,1:47:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Magnificent，he was。Just magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.34,1:47:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.64,1:47:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Would you like me to say a few words？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.10,1:47:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,He had a family，I trust？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.81,1:47:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.65,1:47:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Farewell…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.32,1:47:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aragog.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.70,1:48:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Farewell，Aragog…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.00,1:48:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…king of the arachnids.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.50,1:48:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your body will decay…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.34,1:48:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but your spirit lingers on.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.89,1:48:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,And your human friends find solace in the loss they have sustained.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.70,1:48:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had him from an egg，you know。Tiny little thing he was when he hatched.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.49,1:48:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,No bigger than a Pekinese。A Pekinese，mind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.37,1:48:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,How sweet。I once had a fish。Francis。He was very dear to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.71,1:48:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,One afternoon I came downstairs，and he'd vanished.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.05,1:48:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Poof.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.80,1:49:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's very odd，isn't it？- It is，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.18,1:49:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,But that's life，I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.06,1:49:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You go along and then suddenly，poof！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.57,1:49:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Poof。- Poof.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.79,1:49:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was a student who gave me Francis.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.92,1:49:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,One spring afternoon I discovered a bowl on my desk…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.13,1:49:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,…with just a few inches of clear water in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.89,1:49:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,And floating on the surface was a flower petal.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.98,1:49:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,As I watched，it sank.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.94,1:49:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just before it reached the bottom…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.94,1:49:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…it transformed…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.78,1:50:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,…into a wee fish.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.28,1:50:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was beautiful magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.41,1:50:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wondrous to behold.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.29,1:50:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,The flower petal had come from a lily.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.42,1:50:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.51,1:50:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,The day I came downstairs…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.97,1:50:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the day the bowl was empty…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.80,1:50:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,…was the day your mother…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.98,1:50:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.98,1:50:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.78,1:50:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,It would ruin me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.20,1:50:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know why I survived，professor？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.20,1:50:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,The night I got this？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.79,1:50:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because of her.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.33,1:50:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because she sacrificed herself.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.55,1:50:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because she refused to step aside.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.09,1:51:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because her love was more powerful than Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.47,1:51:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't say his name。- I'm not afraid of the name，professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.01,1:51:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.06,1:51:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something others have only guessed at.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.98,1:51:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.07,1:51:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am the Chosen One.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.36,1:51:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only I can destroy him，but in order to do so…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.74,1:51:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I need to know what Tom Riddle asked you years ago in your office…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.20,1:51:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and I need to know what you told him.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.29,1:51:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be brave，professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.33,1:51:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be brave like my mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.71,1:51:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Otherwise，you disgrace her.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.50,1:51:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Otherwise，she died for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.80,1:51:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Otherwise，the bowl will remain empty forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.57,1:52:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，don't think badly of me when you see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.70,1:52:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've no idea what he was like，even then.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.74,1:52:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was in the library the other night…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.61,1:52:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,…in the Restricted Section…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.66,1:52:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and I read something rather odd about a bit of rare magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.58,1:52:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's called，as I understand it…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.63,1:53:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,…a Horcrux.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.80,1:53:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I beg your pardon？- Horcrux.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.97,1:53:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I came across the term while reading…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.80,1:53:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and I didn't fully understand it.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.97,1:53:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what you were reading，Tom…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.89,1:53:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but this is very dark stuff，very dark indeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.64,1:53:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which is…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.31,1:53:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,…why I came to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.98,1:53:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,A Horcrux is an object in which a person has concealed part of their soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.78,1:53:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I don't understand how that works，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.99,1:53:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,One splits one's soul and hides part of it in an object.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.17,1:53:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,By doing so，you're protected，should you be attacked and your body destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.96,1:53:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Protected？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.25,1:53:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,That part of your soul that is hidden lives on.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.92,1:53:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,In other words，you cannot die.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.52,1:54:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,And how does one split his soul，sir？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.85,1:54:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you already know the answer to that，Tom.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.86,1:54:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.86,1:54:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.74,1:54:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Killing rips the soul apart。It is a violation against nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.53,1:54:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you only split the soul once？For instance，isn't seven…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.46,1:54:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seven？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.71,1:54:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Merlin's beard，Tom。Isn't it bad enough to consider killing one person？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.17,1:54:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,To rip the soul into seven pieces…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.09,1:54:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is all hypothetical，isn't it，Tom？All academic？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.89,1:54:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.19,1:54:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll be our little secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.99,1:54:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.63,1:55:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is beyond anything I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.93,1:55:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mean to say he succeeded，sir，in making a Horcrux？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.76,1:55:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yes，he succeeded，all right。And not just once.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.06,1:55:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are they exactly？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.27,1:55:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could be anything。Most commonplace of objects.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.77,1:55:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,A ring，for example.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.11,1:55:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or a book.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.90,1:55:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Tom Riddle's diary。- It's a Horcrux，yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.78,1:55:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Four years ago，when you saved Ginny's life…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.08,1:55:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,…in the Chamber of Secrets，you brought me this.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.54,1:55:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew this was a different kind of magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.62,1:55:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very dark，very powerful。But until tonight I had no idea just how powerful.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.79,1:55:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The ring？- Belonged to Voldemort's mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.17,1:55:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Difficult to find。Even more difficult to destroy.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.09,1:55:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if you could find them all，if you did destroy each Horcrux…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.14,1:56:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,One destroys Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.47,1:56:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,But how would you find them？They could be hidden anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.56,1:56:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,True。But magic，especially dark magic…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.79,1:56:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,…leaves traces.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.46,1:56:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's where you've been going，isn't it，sir？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.71,1:56:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- When you leave the school？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.84,1:56:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I think perhaps I may have found another.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.10,1:56:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,But this time，I cannot hope to destroy it alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.73,1:56:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once again，I must ask too much of you，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.36,1:56:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you ever considered that you ask too much…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.82,1:56:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,…that you take too much for granted？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.62,1:57:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Has it ever crossed your brilliant mind that I don't want to do this anymore？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.83,1:57:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whether it has or hasn't is irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.83,1:57:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will not negotiate with you，Severus。You agreed。Nothing more to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.02,1:57:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.24,1:57:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need a shave，my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.37,1:57:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，at times，I forget how much you've grown.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.74,1:57:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,At times，I still see the small boy from the cupboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.25,1:57:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forgive my mawkishness，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.09,1:57:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm an old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.75,1:57:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,You still look the same to me，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.88,1:58:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just like your mother，you're unfailingly kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.05,1:58:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,A trait people never fail to undervalue，I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.02,1:58:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,The place to which we journey tonight is extremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.69,1:58:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I promised you could accompany me，and I stand by that promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.36,1:58:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,But there is one condition：
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.36,1:58:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must obey every command I give you，without question.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.45,1:58:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.24,1:58:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,You do understand what I'm saying？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.95,1:58:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Should I tell you to hide，you hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.62,1:58:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Should I tell you to run，you run.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.12,1:58:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Should I tell you to abandon me and save yourself，you must do so.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.30,1:58:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your word，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.51,1:58:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,My word.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.81,1:58:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take my arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.89,1:58:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，I thought you couldn't Apparate within Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.98,1:58:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，being me has its privileges.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.70,1:59:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the place.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.12,1:59:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.62,1:59:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,This place has known magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.21,2:00:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sir！- In order to gain passage…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.92,2:00:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,…payment must be made.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.51,2:00:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Payment intended to weaken any intruder.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.72,2:00:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You should've let me，sir。- No，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.01,2:00:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your blood's much more precious than mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.62,2:00:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Voldemort will not have made it easy to discover his hiding place.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.42,2:00:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,He will have put certain defenses in position.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.34,2:00:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.28,2:01:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.91,2:01:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only question is，how do we get there？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.81,2:01:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you would，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.94,2:02:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think the Horcrux is in there，sir？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.99,2:02:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.46,2:02:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,It has to be drunk.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:44.21,2:02:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,All of it has to be drunk.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.88,2:02:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You remember the conditions on which I brought you with me？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.38,2:02:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,This potion might paralyze me.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.22,2:02:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Might make me forget why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.68,2:02:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Might cause me so much pain that I beg for relief.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.23,2:03:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are not to indulge these requests.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.31,2:03:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's your job，Harry，to make sure I keep drinking this potion.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.02,2:03:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even if you have to force it down my throat.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.94,2:03:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Understood？- Why can't I drink it，sir？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.24,2:03:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because I am much older，much cleverer，and much less valuable.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.58,2:03:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your good health，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.81,2:03:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.23,2:03:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.11,2:03:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.78,2:03:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor，can you hear me？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.57,2:03:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.17,2:04:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Don't.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:13.47,2:04:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have to keep drinking，like you said。Remember？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.06,2:04:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stop。- It will stop。It will stop…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.10,2:04:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …but only if you keep drinking。- Please，don't make me.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.69,2:04:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry，sir。- Please.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.99,2:04:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Kill me。Kill me！- No！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.20,2:04:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.95,2:04:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.00,2:04:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.79,2:04:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just one more，sir。One more，and then I promise…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.84,2:04:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I promise I'll do what you say.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.34,2:04:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I promise。- No.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.22,2:04:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.74,2:05:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.33,2:05:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Water.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.38,2:05:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Water.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.67,2:05:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Water.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.97,2:05:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,You did it，sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.93,2:05:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.39,2:05:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.02,2:05:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Water.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.11,2:05:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aguamenti.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.98,2:05:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Water.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.60,2:06:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lumos.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.43,2:07:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lumos Maxima！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.81,2:07:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.69,2:07:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sectumsempra！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.99,2:07:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.11,2:07:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stupefy！- Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:22.92,2:08:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.22,2:08:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Partis Temporus！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.10,2:09:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go to your houses。No dawdling.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:57.06,2:10:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need to get you to the hospital wing，sir，to Madam Pomfrey.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.19,2:10:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.61,2:10:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Severus。Severus is who I need.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.45,2:10:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wake him。Tell him what happened.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:12.16,2:10:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Speak to no one else.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.45,2:10:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Severus，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:21.96,2:10:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hide yourself below，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.84,2:10:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't speak or be seen by anybody without my permission.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.01,2:10:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever happens，it's imperative you stay below.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:33.60,2:10:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.89,2:10:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.94,2:10:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:03.96,2:11:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good evening，Draco.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:06.67,2:11:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,What brings you here on this fine spring evening？
Dialogue: 0,2:11:10.38,2:11:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who else is here？I heard you talking.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:12.30,2:11:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I often talk aloud to myself。I find it extraordinarily useful.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:18.52,2:11:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you been whispering to yourself，Draco？
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.85,2:11:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Draco…
Dialogue: 0,2:11:25.98,2:11:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You are no assassin。- How do you know what I am？
Dialogue: 0,2:11:29.11,2:11:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've done things that would shock you.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:31.07,2:11:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like cursing Katie Bell and hoping that in return she'd bear a cursed necklace to me？
Dialogue: 0,2:11:35.37,2:11:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Replacing a bottle of mead with one laced with poison？
Dialogue: 0,2:11:38.16,2:11:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forgive me，Draco.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.91,2:11:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I cannot help feeling these actions are so weak…
Dialogue: 0,2:11:42.58,2:11:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,…your heart can't really have been in them.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:45.13,2:11:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,He trusts me。I was chosen.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:52.13,2:11:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then I shall make it easy for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:54.09,2:11:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:59.10,2:12:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very good。Very good.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:03.19,2:12:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:05.73,2:12:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,There are others.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:08.82,2:12:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,How？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:11.53,2:12:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,The vanishing cabinet in the Room of Requirement.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:14.95,2:12:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I've been mending it。- Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:17.49,2:12:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,It has a sister。A twin.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:20.62,2:12:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,In Borgin and Burkes。They form a passage.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:23.00,2:12:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ingenious.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:25.46,2:12:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Draco…
Dialogue: 0,2:12:26.88,2:12:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,…years ago，I knew a boy who made all the wrong choices.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:33.88,2:12:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Please let me help you。- I don't want your help！
Dialogue: 0,2:12:37.60,2:12:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you understand？I have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:42.31,2:12:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.60,2:12:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or he's gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:56.16,2:12:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，look what we have here.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.66,2:13:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done，Draco.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.50,2:13:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good evening，Bellatrix.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:10.38,2:13:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think introductions are in order，don't you？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:12.71,2:13:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Love to，Albus，but I'm afraid we're all on a bit of a tight schedule.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:18.47,2:13:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.14,2:13:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,He doesn't have the stomach，just like his father.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:25.68,2:13:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me finish him in my own way.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:27.35,2:13:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！The Dark Lord was clear，the boy is to do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:31.15,2:13:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is your moment。Do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:34.74,2:13:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on，Draco.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:36.90,2:13:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now！
Dialogue: 0,2:13:40.32,2:13:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:53.55,2:13:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Severus.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:04.10,2:14:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:06.56,2:14:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Avada Kedavra.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.29,2:15:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid！Hello？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:15.92,2:15:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Snape！He trusted you！
Dialogue: 0,2:15:24.30,2:15:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:26.60,2:15:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Incarcerous.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:28.47,2:15:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fight back！You coward，fight back！
Dialogue: 0,2:15:32.77,2:15:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！He belongs to the Dark Lord.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:56.13,2:15:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sectumsempra！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.97,2:16:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You dare use my own spells against me，Potter？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:11.98,2:16:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:13.85,2:16:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm the Half-Blood Prince.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:06.09,2:20:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,McGONAGALL：Potter…
Dialogue: 0,2:20:08.25,2:20:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,…in light of what has happened…
Dialogue: 0,2:20:12.17,2:20:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,…if you should have the need to talk to someone…
Dialogue: 0,2:20:17.43,2:20:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should know，Professor Dumbledore…
Dialogue: 0,2:20:23.27,2:20:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you meant a great deal to him.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:44.00,2:20:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think he would've done it？
Dialogue: 0,2:20:46.33,2:20:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Draco？
Dialogue: 0,2:20:49.30,2:20:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:51.80,2:20:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，he was lowering his wand.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:54.88,2:20:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the end，it was Snape.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:57.47,2:20:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was always Snape.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:00.10,2:21:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I did nothing.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:08.98,2:21:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's fake.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:11.98,2:21:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open it.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:24.33,2:21:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,「To the Dark Lord。I know I will be dead long before you read this…
Dialogue: 0,2:21:28.50,2:21:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I want you to know that it was I who discovered your secret.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:33.17,2:21:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have stolen the real Horcrux and intend to destroy it as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:37.22,2:21:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I face death in the hope that when you meet your match…
Dialogue: 0,2:21:40.43,2:21:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,you will be mortal once more.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.97,2:21:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,R.A.B.「
Dialogue: 0,2:21:46.89,2:21:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,R.A.B.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:48.73,2:21:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:52.02,2:21:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,But whoever they are，they have the real Horcrux.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:55.65,2:21:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which means it was all a waste.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:58.53,2:22:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,All of it.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:06.25,2:22:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron's okay with it，you know.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:08.83,2:22:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,You and Ginny.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:10.96,2:22:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if I were you，when he's around，I'd keep the snogging to a minimum.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:16.01,2:22:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not coming back，Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:19.18,2:22:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got to finish whatever Dumbledore started.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:22.05,2:22:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I don't know where that'll lead me…
Dialogue: 0,2:22:25.06,2:22:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but I'll let you and Ron know where I am when I can.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:30.02,2:22:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've always admired your courage，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:32.82,2:22:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,But sometimes，you can be really thick.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:38.53,2:22:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't really think you're going to be able…
Dialogue: 0,2:22:40.95,2:22:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,…to find all those Horcruxes by yourself，do you？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:47.58,2:22:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need us，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:05.06,2:23:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never realized how beautiful this place was.
